    thinking: "**Initiating Skill Assessment**\n\nMy current focus is on a mandatory skill assessment. I\'ve ruled out `cloudsql-execute-sql` and `cloudsql-setup` as they\'re not relevant to this frontend prototype. Applet-seo isn\'t requested, either. I need to proceed based on this assessment.\n\n\n**Prioritizing Frontend Design**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the frontend design aspect. `cloudsql-update-schema`, `figma-import`, `firebase-integration-rpc`, and `gemini-api` are definitively out of scope. The frontend focus is on creating a mobile-first, responsive, and modern UI, adhering to the specified color palette. I need to deliver three screens with interactive components.\n\n\n"
