  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing File Structure**\n\nI\'ve generated some very clean and tasteful images: `/src/assets/images/auth_safety_editorial_1795271550839.jpg` and `/src/assets/images/map_grid_backdrop_1795271545558.jpg`. Now I\'m moving on to crafting a crisp, modular file structure within the `/src` directory.\n\n\n**Defining Application Metadata**\n\nI\'ve established the application\'s name, \"AuraSafe,\" and provided a description via `/metadata.json`. I\'m now integrating this metadata into `/index.html`, ensuring the title and meta information are synchronized. I\'ve also incorporated Google Fonts \342\200\223 `Plus Jakarta Sans`, `DM Sans`, and `JetBrains Mono` \342\200\223 for a polished visual presentation. I\'m focusing on getting `/src/index.css` prepared.\n\n\n**Constructing Auth Screens**\n\nI\'m now deeply immersed in the UI components, focusing first on a clean Sign In form. I\'m building with name/phone + password inputs, with visibility toggles, a \"Forgot Password\" modal, Google Sign-In with appropriate dialogs, demo credentials, and navigation to account creation. The second screen is for signup, and I\'m tackling profile setup now, full validation, OTP verification, and Google OAuth.\n\n\n**Enumerating Dashboard Features**\n\nI\'m now charting the dashboard components: `TravelModePanel`, `ThreatModeModal`, `SosEmergencyModal`, and `SosContactsModal`. I\'m fleshing out `SmartTriggersSection`, `NearbyLocationsSection`, `AiAssistantPanel`, and a `HelpSection`. I\'m designing `ProfileModal`, `SettingsModal`, and a `NotificationsModal` with a focus on functional elegance. The top-level `App.tsx` will be a 3-screen router for `login`, `signup`, and `dashboard` states.\n\n\n**Validating Design Rules**\n\nI\'m now carefully auditing the design principles before implementation, particularly focusing on the \"Zero-Pill Metadata\" rule to ensure clean presentation of labels and status text without excessive visual ornamentation. I\'m also ensuring the absence of decorative pulsing dots and thick left accent borders. Lastly, I\'m verifying adherence to the 60-30-10 color scheme for a consistent look.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "g6sBa-jlOJn8vdIP9sTQ6QQ"
