  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining Initial Category Prop**\n\nI\'m currently updating `/src/components/dashboard/NearbyLocationsSection.tsx`. My focus is on integrating an optional `initialCategory` prop, which will accept values like \'police\' or \'restrooms\'. This will be pivotal for voice assistant integration, allowing users to specify a category when they request nearby locations. The SOS page will also benefit from this enhancement, as it will enable direct opening of specific location categories.\n\n\n**Structuring New Pages**\n\nI\'ve decided to create `/src/components/pages/NearbyPage.tsx`, which will be a dedicated \"Nearby Safe Places\" page. I\'m rewriting `/src/components/HomeDashboard.tsx` to serve as a clean, separated multi-page authenticated app shell. This will connect the existing components with new pages for Home, SOS, Threat Mode, Travel Mode, and an AI Voice Assistant.\n\n\n**Defining Page Navigation**\n\nI\'m structuring the command controller to navigate across pages and execute safety workflows, which includes a dedicated Nearby page for police stations and restrooms and an access-protected Emergency Evidence History page. To maintain focus, I\'m keeping the Shake/Voice/Gesture trigger demos within Settings or on the AI Voice page, rather than cluttering the Nearby page. I\'m also planning an Active Emergency / Action Toast Banner for threat mode activation.\n\n\n"
