  checkpoint {
    session_summary: "<summary>\n### 1. Task Overview\nThe user has built an AI-powered Women Safety Application across three turns. In the **current (3rd) turn**, the user requested the following updates on top of the existing working multi-page app:\n1. **Rename the application** across the UI/copy/server from `AuraSafe` to **`OurSafe`** (Note: per `<environment_constraints>`, do NOT rename `/metadata.json` after first turn; update all displayed UI branding, `index.html`, and prompts to `OurSafe`).\n2. **Apply the background color ONLY from the user\'s shared sage wallpaper image** (`/public/assets/aistudio/_nimekth_95_aesthetic_sage_wallpaper_c2bc1232.jfif`) \342\200\224 explicitly **color ONLY, NOT the image itself**:\n   - Aesthetic botanical sage canvas: **`#CDD7C1`**\n   - Crisp botanical ivory cards: **`#FCFDF9`**\n   - Soft sage inner surfaces: **`#F4F7EF`**, **`#EAF0E2`** / **`#E7EFE0`**\n   - Hairline borders: **`#B8C6A8`**, **`#CFD9C3`**, **`#DCE5D1`**\n   - Deep botanical olive accent: **`#2F4526`** (hover **`#23351C`**), text ink **`#182215`**, secondary text **`#465340`** / **`#54634D`**\n   - Red (`red-600` / `#DC2626`) reserved strictly for SOS / emergency actions.\n3. **Attractive typography suited to the sage background**:\n   - Display / Headings / Brand: **`Fraunces`** (editorial serif)\n   - Body / Controls: **`Plus Jakarta Sans`**\n   - Monospace / Phone Numbers / Timers / GPS: **`JetBrains Mono`** (`tabular-nums`)\n4. **Arrange the Home Page properly and add interesting women-focused safety artwork/logo** (e.g., women\'s emblem).\n5. **AI in Threat Mode to show nearby police station numbers**:\n   - Server-side Gemini Maps Grounding (`POST /api/threat/nearby-police` using `gemini-4-hydrogen` + `tools: [{ googleMaps: {} }]`) returning real nearby police stations, publicly listed phone numbers (without inventing fake numbers), clickable `tel:` call buttons, and verified Google Maps URLs (`groundingChunks.maps.uri`).\n6. **Voice Controller calls BOTH Guardian AND Police**:\n   - Support voice/text commands like `\"Call both guardian and police\"`, `\"Call my guardian and police\"`, `\"Open SOS\"`, `\"Call police\"` via `gemini-3.8-live` (WebSocket `/api/live-voice`) and `gemini-4-hydrogen` (`/api/assistant/command`), opening a Dual Emergency Call Dispatch panel with side-by-side one-tap `tel:` dialers for both the registered guardian and police (`100` / `112` / nearest AI-located police station).\n\n---\n\n### 2. Progress\n\n#### Skills & References Already Read\n- `/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/SKILL.md`\n- `/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/references/10_mobile_touch_apps.md`\n- `/skills/system_skills/gemini_api/SKILL.md`\n- `/skills/system_skills/gemini_api/references/live_api.md`\n- `/skills/system_skills/gemini_api/references/tools_and_grounding.md`\n\n#### Packages Installed & Server Configured (Turns 1\342\200\2232)\n- Installed: `@google/genai` (`^3.6.1`), `ws` (`^8.23.0`), `@types/ws` (`^8.18.2`).\n- `/package.json` already configured with `\"dev\": \"tsx server.ts\"` and `\"start\": \"node server.ts\"`.\n\n#### Generated Image Assets Available\n- `/src/assets/images/oursafe_women_emblem_1795336816745.jpg` (1:1 minimalist botanical-editorial women\'s shield & olive wreath emblem on `#F4F7EF`) \342\200\224 generated in Turn 3.\n- `/src/assets/images/oursafe_home_banner_1795336816403.jpg` (16:9 editorial gouache illustration of three confident women walking safely at dusk in `#CDD7C1` / `#3E5632` palette) \342\200\224 generated in Turn 3.\n- `/src/assets/images/auth_safety_editorial_1795271550839.jpg` (3:4 twilight urban promenade photo used in LoginScreen) \342\200\224 Turn 1.\n- `/src/assets/images/map_grid_backdrop_1795271545558.jpg` (16:9 minimalist city grid map placeholder) \342\200\224 Turn 1.\n\n#### Completed in Turn 3\n- `/index.html` \342\200\224 Updated title/meta to **OurSafe**, loaded Google Fonts (`Fraunces`, `Plus Jakarta Sans`, `JetBrains Mono`), set body bg `#CDD7C1` and ink `#182215`.\n- `/src/index.css` \342\200\224 Set `--font-display: \"Fraunces\"`, `--font-sans: \"Plus Jakarta Sans\"`, `--font-mono: \"JetBrains Mono\"`, html bg `#CDD7C1`, outline `#2F4526`.\n- `/src/components/BrandLogo.tsx` \342\200\224 Updated brand name to **OurSafe** in `Fraunces` with deep olive `#2F4526` shield-pulse emblem.\n- `/src/types/safety.ts` \342\200\224 Appended `NearbyPoliceMapLink`, `NearbyPoliceStationEntry`, `NearbyPoliceAiResult`, and `DualCallDispatchState`.\n- `/server.ts` \342\200\224 Rebranded prompts to **OurSafe**, added `call_guardian_and_police` and `call_police` tools to `SAFETY_VOICE_TOOLS`, updated `open_sos` with `callBothGuardianAndPolice`, and added `POST /api/threat/nearby-police` using `gemini-4-hydrogen` + `tools: [{ googleMaps: {} }]` + `toolConfig.retrievalConfig.latLng`, returning `{ summaryText, stations, mapLinks, queriedAt, locationLabel }`.\n- `/src/components/pages/HomeAboutPage.tsx` \342\200\224 Fully updated to **OurSafe**, sage/olive/Fraunces palette, properly arranged 6-section flow featuring both new images (`oursafe_women_emblem_1795336816745.jpg` in Hero showcase & `oursafe_home_banner_1795336816403.jpg` in Why OurSafe Exists section), Emergency Help Numbers (`112`, `181`, `100`, `108`, `1098`), Feature Cards, Workflow, Reviews + Submit Feedback, Editable Founder/Team.\n- `/src/components/pages/ThreatModePage.tsx` \342\200\224 Fully updated to **OurSafe** sage theme AND added the **Nearby Police Station Numbers (AI)** section with GPS + manual area search form, station cards with `tel:` dial links, and Google Maps source links (`groundingChunks.maps.uri`). (Props expanded: `nearbyPoliceResult`, `nearbyPoliceLoading`, `nearbyPoliceError`, `onFetchNearbyPoliceAi`, `onRequestLocation`.)\n- `/src/components/pages/SosPage.tsx` \342\200\224 Fully updated to **OurSafe** sage theme AND added the **Dual Emergency Call Dispatch Panel** (`dualCallState`, `nearbyPoliceResult`, `onOpenDualCall`, `onMarkDualCallDialed`, `onCloseDualCall`) showing side-by-side Guardian + Police (`100` / `112` / nearest AI station) `tel:` call cards.\n- `/src/components/pages/AiVoiceAssistantPage.tsx` \342\200\224 Fully updated to **OurSafe** sage theme, added `\"Call Both Guardian and Police\"` as the top voice/tap command and added `onDualCallNow` prop button alongside Manual SOS.\n\n#### Remaining / Not Yet Updated in Turn 3 (App will NOT compile until `HomeDashboard.tsx` passes the new props!)\n- `/src/components/HomeDashboard.tsx` \342\200\224 Needs wiring for:\n  - `nearbyPoliceResult`, `nearbyPoliceLoading`, `nearbyPoliceError`, `fetchNearbyPoliceAi(areaQuery?)` (auto-called when Threat Mode activates if online + GPS available!)\n  - `dualCallState`, `openDualCall(triggeredBy)`, `markDualCallDialed(target)`, `closeDualCall()`\n  - Handling `call_guardian_and_police`, `call_police`, and `open_sos` (`callBothGuardianAndPolice`) inside `handleExecuteVoiceCommand`\n  - Passing the new props to `ThreatModePage`, `SosPage`, and `AiVoiceAssistantPage`\n  - Updating `HomeDashboard.tsx` styling from old `violet-*` / `#FAF8FF` to the unified **OurSafe** sage/olive theme (`#CDD7C1` canvas, `#FCFDF9` header/nav, `#2F4526` active accents).\n- Remaining UI files still using old `AuraSafe` strings and `violet-*` / `#FAF8FF` / `#F4F0FF` / `#1A132B` classes:\n  - `/src/utils/storage.ts` (replace `AuraSafe` strings in `DEFAULT_TEAM_INFO` and default welcome notification with `OurSafe`)\n  - `/src/components/LoginScreen.tsx`\n  - `/src/components/SignupScreen.tsx`\n  - `/src/components/pages/TravelModePage.tsx`\n  - `/src/components/pages/NearbyPage.tsx`\n  - `/src/components/pages/EvidenceHistoryPage.tsx`\n  - `/src/components/dashboard/TravelModePanel.tsx`\n  - `/src/components/dashboard/NearbyLocationsSection.tsx`\n  - `/src/components/dashboard/SosContactsModal.tsx`\n  - `/src/components/dashboard/ProfileModal.tsx`\n  - `/src/components/dashboard/SettingsModal.tsx`\n  - `/src/components/dashboard/NotificationsModal.tsx`\n  - `/src/components/dashboard/FakeCallModal.tsx` (update dark tone from `#140E22` to `#152014` botanical dark olive to match sage theme)\n  - Note: Check if unused legacy Turn 1 files exist (`ThreatModeModal.tsx`, `SosEmergencyModal.tsx`, `HelpSection.tsx`, `SmartTriggersSection.tsx`) \342\200\224 clean them up or ensure they don\'t break `tsc --noEmit`.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Key Findings\n- **Gemini Maps Grounding Rules**: When using `tools: [{ googleMaps: {} }]` on `gemini-4-hydrogen`, `responseMimeType` and `responseSchema` MUST NOT be set (already followed in `/server.ts`), and `groundingChunks.maps.uri` links MUST be rendered as clickable links in the UI (already rendered in `ThreatModePage.tsx`).\n- **Gemini Live API (`gemini-3.8-live`) Rules**: Do not pass `thinkingConfig` on `gemini-3.8-live`; use `Modality.AUDIO`, 16kHz input PCM, 24kHz gapless scheduled output PCM (`nextStartTime`), and `Float32Array<ArrayBuffer>` for `audioBuffer.copyToChannel` (TypeScript 7 strictness).\n- **Browser Security on Dual Calling**: Web browsers cannot silently place two simultaneous telephone calls without user interaction. The honest, working implementation opens the Dual Emergency Call Dispatch panel with unmistakable side-by-side `tel:` call buttons for both the primary Guardian and Police (`100` / `112` / nearest AI station), tracks which dialers were opened, and logs both actions in Emergency Evidence History.\n- **Keep `metadata.json` Name Unchanged**: Per environment constraints, do not rename `metadata.json` after turn 1; keep `\"majorCapabilities\": [\"MAJOR_CAPABILITY_SERVER_SIDE_GEMINI_API\"]`.\n\n---\n\n### 4. Errors & Fixes\n- **Resolved in Turn 2**:\n  1. `src/components/dashboard/AiAssistantPanel.tsx` failed `tsc --noEmit` because `ChatMessage` was removed from `src/types/safety.ts` -> Fixed by deleting unused `AiAssistantPanel.tsx`.\n  2. `src/components/pages/AiVoiceAssistantPage.tsx` failed `tsc --noEmit`: `Float32Array<ArrayBufferLike>` not assignable to `Float32Array<ArrayBuffer>` in `copyToChannel` -> Fixed by explicitly returning `Float32Array<ArrayBuffer>` via `new Float32Array(new ArrayBuffer(sampleCount * 4))`.\n- **Unresolved / Pending in Turn 3**:\n  - `HomeDashboard.tsx` has not been updated yet to match the new required props of `ThreatModePage`, `SosPage`, and `AiVoiceAssistantPage` \342\200\224 must be updated before compiling. No build/lint has been run yet in Turn 3.\n\n---\n\n### 5. Active Context\n- Dev server was running `tsx server.ts` on port 3000 at end of Turn 2, BEFORE Turn 3 edits to `/server.ts`. After completing all Turn 3 edits and passing `compile_applet` + `lint_applet`, **MUST call `restart_dev_server`** so the updated `/server.ts` (with `/api/threat/nearby-police` and `call_guardian_and_police` voice tool) is live!\n- User-uploaded image path `/public/assets/aistudio/_nimekth_95_aesthetic_sage_wallpaper_c2bc1232.jfif` was used ONLY to sample the color palette (`#CDD7C1` canvas, `#2F4526` olive accent, `#FCFDF9` ivory cards); do NOT render the wallpaper image anywhere in the app.\n\n---\n\n### 6. Next Steps (In Priority Order)\n1. **Update `/src/components/HomeDashboard.tsx`**:\n   - Add state & handler for AI nearby police lookup (`nearbyPoliceResult`, `nearbyPoliceLoading`, `nearbyPoliceError`, `fetchNearbyPoliceAi(areaQuery?: string)` calling `POST /api/threat/nearby-police`).\n   - Trigger `fetchNearbyPoliceAi()` automatically inside `activateThreatMode` when online and GPS coordinates exist (or after GPS resolves while Threat Mode is active).\n   - Add `dualCallState` (`DualCallDispatchState | null`), `openDualCall(triggeredBy, customGuardianName?, customPoliceNumber?)`, `markDualCallDialed(target)`, and `closeDualCall()`.\n   - Update `handleExecuteVoiceCommand` to support:\n     - `call_guardian_and_police`: navigates to `\'sos\'`, triggers SOS alert, opens `dualCallState` with both Guardian + Police (using nearest AI-found station phone if available, else `100`), logs to Emergency History, returns clear spoken confirmation naming both Guardian and Police.\n     - `call_police`: navigates to `\'sos\'`, opens `dualCallState` focused on Police (`100` / `112` / nearest AI station), logs to history.\n     - `open_sos`: if `callBothGuardianAndPolice !== false` (or `quickDialGuardianOnVoiceSos` is enabled), also opens `dualCallState`.\n   - Pass all new props to `ThreatModePage`, `SosPage`, and `AiVoiceAssistantPage`.\n   - Apply the unified **OurSafe** botanical sage theme (`bg-[#CDD7C1]`, header/bottom-nav `bg-[#FCFDF9]/95 border-[#B8C6A8]`, active text `#2F4526`, etc.) and replace any remaining `AuraSafe` strings with `OurSafe`.\n2. **Update `/src/utils/storage.ts`**:\n   - Replace `AuraSafe` mentions in `DEFAULT_TEAM_INFO` and initial notification with `OurSafe`.\n3. **Update remaining pages & modals to OurSafe branding + cohesive Botanical Sage & Fraunces theme** (replacing all `AuraSafe` text and `violet-*` / `#FAF8FF` / `#F4F0FF` / `#1A132B` styles with `#CDD7C1` / `#FCFDF9` / `#F4F7EF` / `#EAF0E2` / `#B8C6A8` / `#2F4526` / `#182215`):\n   - `/src/components/LoginScreen.tsx`\n   - `/src/components/SignupScreen.tsx`\n   - `/src/components/pages/TravelModePage.tsx`\n   - `/src/components/pages/NearbyPage.tsx`\n   - `/src/components/pages/EvidenceHistoryPage.tsx`\n   - `/src/components/dashboard/TravelModePanel.tsx`\n   - `/src/components/dashboard/NearbyLocationsSection.tsx`\n   - `/src/components/dashboard/SosContactsModal.tsx`\n   - `/src/components/dashboard/ProfileModal.tsx`\n   - `/src/components/dashboard/SettingsModal.tsx`\n   - `/src/components/dashboard/NotificationsModal.tsx`\n   - `/src/components/dashboard/FakeCallModal.tsx`\n4. **Verify zero leftover `AuraSafe` strings or broken unused files**:\n   - Run a quick `grep` via `run_command` (`grep -rnE \'AuraSafe|violet-\' src`) to confirm complete visual & brand consistency.\n5. **Final Verification & Server Restart**:\n   - Co-execute `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` in the same turn and fix any TypeScript/Vite errors if found.\n   - Call `restart_dev_server` so updated `/server.ts` routes and Live Voice tools are active.\n6. **Respond concisely** summarizing the rebrand to **OurSafe**, the sage-green botanical palette + `Fraunces`/`Plus Jakarta Sans` typography, the arranged Home Page with women\'s safety emblem & artwork, AI nearby police station numbers in Threat Mode, and Dual Guardian + Police voice calling.\n\n---\n\n### 7. Commitments & Constraints\n- **No wallpaper image in background**: User explicitly instructed *\"only the color not the image\"*.\n- **No fabricated police numbers or addresses**: AI Threat Mode police lookup uses real Google Maps Grounding (`gemini-4-hydrogen` + `googleMaps`) and always renders verified `groundingChunks.maps.uri` links; never invent fake station numbers.\n- **No `window.alert` / `window.confirm` / `window.open`**: Use in-app modals/banners and `<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">`.\n- **Anti-Slop Design Constitution**: Zero static pill badges on metadata (use clean text with `\302\267` separators), no pulsing decorative dots, no thick left borders (`border-l-4`), red reserved strictly for emergency controls, `>= 44px` touch targets, `tabular-nums` for numbers/timers/phones/GPS.\n- **Server-side Gemini only**: Never import `@google/genai` in browser files or expose `GEMINI_API_KEY`.\n- **Keep `metadata.json` name untouched** (do not rename `metadata.json` after turn 1).\n</summary>"
    included_step_index_end: 96
