          <div>\\n            <p className=\\\"text-xs font-semibold text-[#3E5632]\\\">\\n              Founder, Team &amp; Mission\\n            </p>\", \"StartLine\":612, \"TargetContent\":\"      {/* 6. Founder & Team Details (Editable Placeholders) */}\\n      <section className=\\\"bg-[#FCFDF9] rounded-3xl border border-[#B8C6A8] p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm shadow-[#182215]/[0.03]\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-5\\\">\\n          <div>\\n            <p className=\\\"text-xs font-semibold text-[#3E5632]\\\">\\n              Founder, Team &amp; Mission \302\267 Editable Placeholders\\n            </p>\"}], \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/pages/HomeAboutPage.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Removing prototype wording from HomeAboutPage\", \"toolSummary\":\"Clean HomeAboutPage copy\"}"
