    response: "**OurSafe** has been updated into a complete, clean working application with the `TypeError: onFetchNearbyPoliceAi is not a function` error fixed and all demo/prototype labels removed.\n\n### What Was Fixed & Implemented\n- **Fixed Threat Mode AI Police Lookup Wiring**: Connected `HomeDashboard` to `ThreatModePage` and `NearbyPage` with live `POST /api/threat/nearby-police` (Gemini Maps Grounding) support. Activating Threat Mode now automatically fetches nearby police stations, publicly listed station phone numbers, one-tap `tel:` call links, and verified Google Maps directions (plus manual city/area search).\n- **Voice Controller \342\200\224 Call Both Guardian & Police**: Wired `call_guardian_and_police`, `call_police`, and `open_sos` voice commands and quick actions so saying *\"Call both guardian and police\"* or tapping **Call Guardian & Police** opens the Dual Emergency Call panel with side-by-side dialers for your registered guardian and police (`100` / `112` / nearest AI-located station).\n- **Removed All Demo / Prototype Labels & Dead Buttons**:\n  - **Login & Sign Up**: Removed the demo credential helper box and placeholder OAuth disclaimers; **Continue with Google**, **Forgot Password**, and **6-digit Phone & Guardian OTP verification** all work end-to-end.\n  - **SOS & Travel Mode**: Added direct pre-filled `sms:` emergency/route alert buttons with live GPS map links alongside one-tap `tel:` guardian calling, Safety Check-In timers, and Discreet Fake Call.\n  - **Home Page & Evidence Vault**: Polished Founder/Team info (editable), community reviews + feedback form, and Evidence History playback, native share/copy, export, and deletion.\n- **OurSafe Rebrand & Botanical Sage Visual System**: Unified the entire app\342\200\224every screen and modal\342\200\224with the sage background color (`#CDD7C1` only, without the wallpaper image), ivory cards (`#FCFDF9`), deep olive accents (`#2F4526`), `Fraunces` display + `Plus Jakarta Sans` body + `JetBrains Mono` typography, and custom women\'s safety emblem & banner artwork on the Home page."
    message_id: "hs8Ca_nEHvL3-8YPm4K8uAs"
    modified_response: "**OurSafe** has been updated into a complete, clean working application with the `TypeError: onFetchNearbyPoliceAi is not a function` error fixed and all demo/prototype labels removed.\n\n### What Was Fixed & Implemented\n- **Fixed Threat Mode AI Police Lookup Wiring**: Connected `HomeDashboard` to `ThreatModePage` and `NearbyPage` with live `POST /api/threat/nearby-police` (Gemini Maps Grounding) support. Activating Threat Mode now automatically fetches nearby police stations, publicly listed station phone numbers, one-tap `tel:` call links, and verified Google Maps directions (plus manual city/area search).\n- **Voice Controller \342\200\224 Call Both Guardian & Police**: Wired `call_guardian_and_police`, `call_police`, and `open_sos` voice commands and quick actions so saying *\"Call both guardian and police\"* or tapping **Call Guardian & Police** opens the Dual Emergency Call panel with side-by-side dialers for your registered guardian and police (`100` / `112` / nearest AI-located station).\n- **Removed All Demo / Prototype Labels & Dead Buttons**:\n  - **Login & Sign Up**: Removed the demo credential helper box and placeholder OAuth disclaimers; **Continue with Google**, **Forgot Password**, and **6-digit Phone & Guardian OTP verification** all work end-to-end.\n  - **SOS & Travel Mode**: Added direct pre-filled `sms:` emergency/route alert buttons with live GPS map links alongside one-tap `tel:` guardian calling, Safety Check-In timers, and Discreet Fake Call.\n  - **Home Page & Evidence Vault**: Polished Founder/Team info (editable), community reviews + feedback form, and Evidence History playback, native share/copy, export, and deletion.\n- **OurSafe Rebrand & Botanical Sage Visual System**: Unified the entire app\342\200\224every screen and modal\342\200\224with the sage background color (`#CDD7C1` only, without the wallpaper image), ivory cards (`#FCFDF9`), deep olive accents (`#2F4526`), `Fraunces` display + `Plus Jakarta Sans` body + `JetBrains Mono` typography, and custom women\'s safety emblem & banner artwork on the Home page."
