to automatically go to the SOS. So only the voice AI voice integrated.\n\nShare my business means only share the locations to the share the locations to the guardian and the police also. This every thing in this app was based on the women users for for her safety against arrest or some other problems created by them. This will keep them to safe. Make it properly."
