      text: "The app we\'ve recorded is very good, but add some features like in the dread mode. While we are on the dread mode, start audio recording and start video recording automatically. Do not need any confirmations. In the dread mode, we want to record the video and audio continuously for the safety purpose.\n\nAnd in some features, the location from location to the two locations in the Google Map, we want to maintain, we want to clear the perfect locations. In the travel time, the vehicle moving away from the route or something in different route that are not shown by Google Map, it want to alert us. It want to alert the mobile users.\n\nAnd the SOS process, the phone was off, but we calling red red rose gateway, it want to make call automatically. Only not call, it want to make call automatically and want to send the messages also automatically. Make it fully perfectly safety secure. I feel the user user safety and secure.\n\nAnd in a travel mode, we add options like verify verify verify or any photo income. It keeps the user user to safe user user to safe. Verify means verify the auto number. Is the number is available in the source or not auto number or any other number the number sources or not it is fake or not in the travel mode. It kept the user safe.\n\nNext, we want to add okay, find police number A. The AI want to use to find the nearest location of the police police stations. Then okay, now make it now I\'m saving the same thing. Make it perfectly and it is the final outcome. I will connect the backend to the this project. So make it clearly and once more check all the systems are working, all the numbers are correctly loading and CSS, HTML are correctly working and Google Maps everything want to check.\n\nEverything was to build in automated, not our manual working. And in the AI voice, when the AI system is on, the app was the total app was based on the voice income, not the manual income. Like go the SOS means we want to go the app want to automatically go to the SOS. So only the voice AI voice integrated.\n\nShare my business means only share the locations to the share the locations to the guardian and the police also. This every thing in this app was based on the women users for for her safety against arrest or some other problems created by them. This will keep them to safe. Make it properly."
