  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Google Maps Functionality**\n\nI\'m diving deep into the `google_maps_platform` skill. The focus now is on implementing Google Maps for two-location route tracking in Travel Mode. I need to figure out how to track a route from a starting point to two destinations and generate alerts for any deviations. Essentially, I need to maintain and \'clear\' perfect locations.\n\n\n**Prioritizing Setup Workflow**\n\nI\'ve shifted gears. My priority is now ensuring the mandatory enablement workflow for the Google Maps Platform is executed. I recognize I need to call `CheckMapsDemoKeyEligibilityAndTos` via `rpc_action`, then `show_aistudio_ui` with the `google_maps_setup` interface before proceeding further. Integrating the real Google Maps JS API (`@vis.gl/react`) will happen after this prerequisite is met and confirmation is provided.\n\n\n"
