    thinking: "**Wiring New Pages**\n\nI\'m making good progress wiring up the updated pages in parallel! Specifically, I\'m focusing on `/src/components/pages/ThreatModePage.tsx`. The key feature there is that it will auto-start continuous video and audio recording the instant Threat Mode activates, without any manual confirmation dialogs.\n\n\n**Prioritizing Fallback Recording**\n\nI\'m now prioritizing audio-only recording as a fallback for Threat Mode. If the camera is unavailable, I\'ll switch seamlessly to audio, ensuring continuous evidence capture. I\'ll also add a prominent \"CONTINUOUS AUTO-RECORDING ACTIVE (Video + Audio)\" indicator, plus a live video preview. This data will auto-save to IndexedDB on deactivation.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "kBIDa63ZJ-a5sOIPmeWjsA8"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_12292622787766718753"
      name: "multi_replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"Description\":\"Auto-start continuous Video+Audio recording (with automatic Audio fallback) immediately when Threat Mode activates without extra confirmations\", \"Instruction\":\"Add automatic continuous recording trigger on Threat Mode activation, fallback cleanly from video+audio to audio-only if camera is unavailable, and update copy to reflect automatic continuous safety capture\", \"ReplacementChunks\":[{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":105, \"ReplacementContent\":\"  const primaryGuardian = contacts.find((c) => c.isPrimary) ?? contacts[0];\\n  const isActive = Boolean(threatSession?.active);\\n  const autoStartedSessionRef = useRef<string | null>(null);\\n  const recordingModeRef = useRef<\'none\' | \'audio\' | \'video\'>(\'none\');\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    recordingModeRef.current = recordingMode;\\n  }, [recordingMode]);\", \"StartLine\":102, \"TargetContent\":\"  const primaryGuardian = contacts.find((c) => c.isPrimary) ?? contacts[0];\\n  const isActive = Boolean(threatSession?.active);\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":370, \"ReplacementContent\":\"  const startRecording = async (\\n    kind: \'audio\' | \'video\',\\n    options?: { allowAudioFallback?: boolean; skipActivate?: boolean }\\n  ) => {\\n    setRecordingError(\'\');\\n    setRecordingSavedNotice(\'\');\\n\\n    if (typeof MediaRecorder === \'undefined\' || !navigator.mediaDevices?.getUserMedia) {\\n      setRecordingError(\\n        \'Media recording is not supported in this browser environment.\'\\n      );\\n      return;\\n    }\\n\\n    if (!isActive && !options?.skipActivate) {\\n      onActivateThreatMode(`Threat Mode ${kind} recording`);\\n    }\\n\\n    stopRecording();\\n\\n    let resolvedKind: \'audio\' | \'video\' = kind;\\n    let stream: MediaStream;\\n\\n    try {\\n      stream = await navigator.mediaDevices.getUserMedia(\\n        kind === \'video\'\\n          ? { audio: true, video: { facingMode: \'environment\' } }\\n          : { audio: true }\\n      );\\n    } catch {\\n      if (kind === \'video\' && options?.allowAudioFallback) {\\n        try {\\n          resolvedKind = \'audio\';\\n          stream = await navigator.mediaDevices.getUserMedia({ audio: true });\\n          setRecordingError(\\n            \'Camera unavailable \342\200\224 automatically switched to continuous Audio recording.\'\\n          );\\n        } catch {\\n          setRecordingError(\\n            \'Camera & microphone permissions were blocked by the browser. Allow mic/camera access so Threat Mode can auto-record continuously.\'\\n          );\\n          return;\\n        }\\n      } else {\\n        setRecordingError(\\n          `Permission for ${kind === \'video\' ? \'camera/microphone\' : \'microphone\'} was denied or device is unavailable.`\\n        );\\n        return;\\n      }\\n    }\\n\\n    try {\\n      mediaStreamRef.current = stream;\\n\\n      if (resolvedKind === \'video\') {\\n        window.setTimeout(() => {\\n          if (videoPreviewRef.current) {\\n            videoPreviewRef.current.srcObject = stream;\\n            videoPreviewRef.current.play().catch(() => {});\\n          }\\n        }, 50);\\n      }\\n\\n      const preferredMime =\\n        resolvedKind === \'video\'\\n          ? MediaRecorder.isTypeSupported(\'video/webm;codecs=vp8,opus\')\\n            ? \'video/webm;codecs=vp8,opus\'\\n            : \'video/webm\'\\n          : MediaRecorder.isTypeSupported(\'audio/webm;codecs=opus\')\\n            ? \'audio/webm;codecs=opus\'\\n            : \'audio/webm\';\\n\\n      const recorder = new MediaRecorder(\\n        stream,\\n        MediaRecorder.isTypeSupported(preferredMime)\\n          ? { mimeType: preferredMime }\\n          : undefined\\n      );\\n      chunksRef.current = [];\\n      recordStartTimeRef.current = Date.now();\\n\\n      recorder.ondataavailable = (ev) => {\\n        if (ev.data && ev.data.size > 0) {\\n          chunksRef.current.push(ev.data);\\n        }\\n      };\\n\\n      recorder.onstop = async () => {\\n        const durationSec = Math.max(\\n          1,\\n          Math.round((Date.now() - recordStartTimeRef.current) / 1000)\\n        );\\n        const blob = new Blob(chunksRef.current, {\\n          type:\\n            recorder.mimeType ||\\n            (resolvedKind === \'video\' ? \'video/webm\' : \'audio/webm\'),\\n        });\\n        const recId = `rec-${Date.now()}`;\\n        const coords =\\n          geoLocation.status === \'granted\' &&\\n          geoLocation.latitude !== null &&\\n          geoLocation.longitude !== null\\n            ? `${geoLocation.latitude.toFixed(5)}, ${geoLocation.longitude.toFixed(5)}`\\n            : undefined;\\n\\n        try {\\n          await saveRecordingToDb({\\n            id: recId,\\n            userId,\\n            kind: resolvedKind,\\n            mimeType: blob.type,\\n            createdAt: new Date().toISOString(),\\n            durationSec,\\n            sizeBytes: blob.size,\\n            sessionId: threatSession?.sessionId,\\n            locationCoords: coords,\\n            sharedWithGuardians: false,\\n            blob,\\n          });\\n          onRecordingSaved({\\n            id: recId,\\n            kind: resolvedKind,\\n            durationSec,\\n            locationCoords: coords,\\n          });\\n          setRecordingSavedNotice(\\n            `${resolvedKind === \'video\' ? \'Video + Audio\' : \'Audio\'} evidence (${durationSec}s) saved securely to local Evidence History.`\\n          );\\n        } catch {\\n          setRecordingError(\\n            \'Recording finished, but local IndexedDB storage was unavailable in this browser.\'\\n          );\\n        }\\n        setRecordingMode(\'none\');\\n        onUpdateThreatSnapshot({ recordingMode: \'none\' });\\n      };\\n\\n      mediaRecorderRef.current = recorder;\\n      recorder.start(1000);\\n      setRecordingMode(resolvedKind);\\n      onUpdateThreatSnapshot({ recordingMode: resolvedKind });\\n    } catch {\\n      setRecordingError(\\n        \'Unable to initialize MediaRecorder in this browser.\'\\n      );\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  // Automatically start continuous Video + Audio recording (no manual confirmation) whenever Threat Mode activates\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    const activeSessionId = threatSession?.active ? threatSession.sessionId : null;\\n    if (!activeSessionId) {\\n      autoStartedSessionRef.current = null;\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (\\n      autoStartedSessionRef.current === activeSessionId ||\\n      recordingModeRef.current !== \'none\'\\n    ) {\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    autoStartedSessionRef.current = activeSessionId;\\n    void startRecording(\'video\', {\\n      allowAudioFallback: true,\\n      skipActivate: true,\\n    });\\n    // eslint-disable-next-line react-hooks/exhaustive-deps\\n  }, [threatSession?.active, threatSession?.sessionId]);\\n\\n  const handleDeactivate = () => {\\n    stopRecording();\\n    stopAttentionTone();\\n    onDeactivateThreatMode(\'Deactivated safely by user\');\\n  };\", \"StartLine\":247, \"TargetContent\":\"  const startRecording = async (kind: \'audio\' | \'video\') => {\\n    setRecordingError(\'\');\\n    setRecordingSavedNotice(\'\');\\n\\n    if (typeof MediaRecorder === \'undefined\' || !navigator.mediaDevices?.getUserMedia) {\\n      setRecordingError(\\n        \'Media recording is not supported in this browser environment.\'\\n      );\\n      return;\\n    }\\n\\n    if (!isActive) {\\n      onActivateThreatMode(`Threat Mode ${kind} recording`);\\n    }\\n\\n    stopRecording();\\n\\n    try {\\n      const stream = await navigator.mediaDevices.getUserMedia(\\n        kind === \'video\'\\n          ? { audio: true, video: { facingMode: \'environment\' } }\\n          : { audio: true }\\n      );\\n      mediaStreamRef.current = stream;\\n\\n      if (kind === \'video\') {\\n        window.setTimeout(() => {\\n          if (videoPreviewRef.current) {\\n            videoPreviewRef.current.srcObject = stream;\\n            videoPreviewRef.current.play().catch(() => {});\\n          }\\n        }, 50);\\n      }\\n\\n      const preferredMime =\\n        kind === \'video\'\\n          ? MediaRecorder.isTypeSupported(\'video/webm;codecs=vp8,opus\')\\n            ? \'video/webm;codecs=vp8,opus\'\\n            : \'video/webm\'\\n          : MediaRecorder.isTypeSupported(\'audio/webm;codecs=opus\')\\n            ? \'audio/webm;codecs=opus\'\\n            : \'audio/webm\';\\n\\n      const recorder = new MediaRecorder(\\n        stream,\\n        MediaRecorder.isTypeSupported(preferredMime)\\n          ? { mimeType: preferredMime }\\n          : undefined\\n      );\\n      chunksRef.current = [];\\n      recordStartTimeRef.current = Date.now();\\n\\n      recorder.ondataavailable = (ev) => {\\n        if (ev.data && ev.data.size > 0) {\\n          chunksRef.current.push(ev.data);\\n        }\\n      };\\n\\n      recorder.onstop = async () => {\\n        const durationSec = Math.max(\\n          1,\\n          Math.round((Date.now() - recordStartTimeRef.current) / 1000)\\n        );\\n        const blob = new Blob(chunksRef.current, {\\n          type:\\n            recorder.mimeType ||\\n            (kind === \'video\' ? \'video/webm\' : \'audio/webm\'),\\n        });\\n        const recId = `rec-${Date.now()}`;\\n        const coords =\\n          geoLocation.status === \'granted\' &&\\n          geoLocation.latitude !== null &&\\n          geoLocation.longitude !== null\\n            ? `${geoLocation.latitude.toFixed(5)}, ${geoLocation.longitude.toFixed(5)}`\\n            : undefined;\\n\\n        try {\\n          await saveRecordingToDb({\\n            id: recId,\\n            userId,\\n            kind,\\n            mimeType: blob.type,\\n            createdAt: new Date().toISOString(),\\n            durationSec,\\n            sizeBytes: blob.size,\\n            sessionId: threatSession?.sessionId,\\n            locationCoords: coords,\\n            sharedWithGuardians: false,\\n            blob,\\n          });\\n          onRecordingSaved({\\n            id: recId,\\n            kind,\\n            durationSec,\\n            locationCoords: coords,\\n          });\\n          setRecordingSavedNotice(\\n            `${kind === \'video\' ? \'Video\' : \'Audio\'} evidence (${durationSec}s) saved securely to local Evidence History.`\\n          );\\n        } catch {\\n          setRecordingError(\\n            \'Recording finished, but local IndexedDB storage was unavailable in this browser.\'\\n          );\\n        }\\n        setRecordingMode(\'none\');\\n        onUpdateThreatSnapshot({ recordingMode: \'none\' });\\n      };\\n\\n      mediaRecorderRef.current = recorder;\\n      recorder.start(1000);\\n      setRecordingMode(kind);\\n      onUpdateThreatSnapshot({ recordingMode: kind });\\n    } catch {\\n      setRecordingError(\\n        `Permission for ${kind === \'video\' ? \'camera/microphone\' : \'microphone\'} was denied or device is unavailable.`\\n      );\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleDeactivate = () => {\\n    stopRecording();\\n    stopAttentionTone();\\n    onDeactivateThreatMode(\'Deactivated safely by user\');\\n  };\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":495, \"ReplacementContent\":\"            <p className=\\\"text-sm text-[#465340] leading-relaxed\\\">\\n              Activating Threat Mode <strong>automatically starts continuous Video &amp; Audio recording</strong> (zero extra confirmations), alerts your guardians, queries AI for nearby police station numbers around your location, and preserves GPS heartbeat snapshots every 10 seconds.\\n            </p>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3\\\">\\n            {isActive ? (\\n              <>\\n                <button\\n                  type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                  onClick={onEscalateToSos}\\n                  className=\\\"min-h-[48px] px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-red-600 hover:bg-red-700 text-white text-sm font-bold inline-flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer whitespace-nowrap\\\"\\n                >\\n                  <ShieldAlert className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n                  <span>Escalate to SOS</span>\\n                </button>\\n                <button\\n                  type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                  onClick={handleDeactivate}\\n                  className=\\\"min-h-[48px] px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-white hover:bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-300 text-emerald-800 text-sm font-semibold inline-flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer whitespace-nowrap\\\"\\n                >\\n                  <CheckCircle2 className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600\\\" />\\n                  <span>I&apos;m Safe \342\200\224 Stop &amp; Save</span>\\n                </button>\\n              </>\\n            ) : (\\n              <button\\n                type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                onClick={() => onActivateThreatMode(\'Threat Mode Page\')}\\n                className=\\\"min-h-[50px] px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-red-600 hover:bg-red-700 text-white text-sm font-bold inline-flex items-center gap-2 shadow-sm cursor-pointer whitespace-nowrap\\\"\\n              >\\n                <AlertTriangle className=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" />\\n                <span>Activate Threat Mode (Auto-Record)</span>\\n              </button>\\n            )}\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Continuous Auto-Recording Status Banner when Active */}\\n        {isActive && recordingMode !== \'none\' && (\\n          <div className=\\\"mt-5 rounded-2xl bg-red-600 text-white px-4 py-3 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-white animate-ping shrink-0\\\" />\\n              <span>\\n                AUTO-RECORDING CONTINUOUSLY (\\n                {recordingMode === \'video\' ? \'Video + Audio\' : \'Audio Fallback\'}) \302\267{\' \'}\\n                <span className=\\\"font-mono tabular-nums\\\">\\n                  {String(Math.floor(recordingSeconds / 60)).padStart(2, \'0\')}:\\n                  {String(recordingSeconds % 60).padStart(2, \'0\')}\\n                </span>\\n              </span>\\n            </div>\\n            <button\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              onClick={stopRecording}\\n              className=\\\"px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-white text-red-700 text-xs font-extrabold cursor-pointer whitespace-nowrap\\\"\\n            >\\n              Stop &amp; Save Clip Now\\n            </button>\\n          </div>\\n        )}\", \"StartLine\":453, \"TargetContent\":\"            <p className=\\\"text-sm text-[#465340] leading-relaxed\\\">\\n              Activating Threat Mode notifies your guardian network, automatically queries AI for nearby police station numbers around your location, enables local audio/video recording, and preserves GPS heartbeat snapshots.\\n            </p>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3\\\">\\n            {isActive ? (\\n              <>\\n                <button\\n                  type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                  onClick={onEscalateToSos}\\n                  className=\\\"min-h-[48px] px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-red-600 hover:bg-red-700 text-white text-sm font-bold inline-flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer whitespace-nowrap\\\"\\n                >\\n                  <ShieldAlert className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n                  <span>Escalate to SOS</span>\\n                </button>\\n                <button\\n                  type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                  onClick={handleDeactivate}\\n                  className=\\\"min-h-[48px] px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-white hover:bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-300 text-emerald-800 text-sm font-semibold inline-flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer whitespace-nowrap\\\"\\n                >\\n                  <CheckCircle2 className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600\\\" />\\n                  <span>I&apos;m Safe \342\200\224 Deactivate</span>\\n                </button>\\n              </>\\n            ) : (\\n              <button\\n                type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                onClick={() => onActivateThreatMode(\'Threat Mode Page\')}\\n                className=\\\"min-h-[50px] px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-red-600 hover:bg-red-700 text-white text-sm font-bold inline-flex items-center gap-2 shadow-sm cursor-pointer whitespace-nowrap\\\"\\n              >\\n                <AlertTriangle className=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" />\\n                <span>Activate Threat Mode</span>\\n              </button>\\n            )}\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":765, \"ReplacementContent\":\"          <p className=\\\"text-xs text-[#4B5844] leading-relaxed\\\">\\n            Starts <strong>automatically without confirmation</strong> as soon as Threat Mode activates (Video + Audio, with automatic Audio fallback if camera is unavailable). All evidence saves privately to your device (IndexedDB) and can be reviewed, shared, or deleted in Evidence History.\\n          </p>\", \"StartLine\":759, \"TargetContent\":\"          <p className=\\\"text-xs text-[#4B5844] leading-relaxed\\\">\\n            Recordings require explicit browser microphone/camera permission, stay stored privately on your device (IndexedDB), and can be played back, shared as an evidence summary with guardians, or permanently deleted anytime from Evidence History.\\n          </p>\"}], \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/pages/ThreatModePage.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Enabling automatic continuous recording in ThreatModePage.tsx\", \"toolSummary\":\"Update ThreatModePage.tsx for auto-recording\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\253\020\n\250\020\001i\024}\023e\301`\354\244\222\277\230I\017\327c9\b\022K\354I\270d\333r9L\006\222itUj\276L\254\004n\374n9[?\177r\370\232\270\320\3032\344\332\236\210\2506\270&Z\311e\264\261\257E\322\331\177\217\263\036G\201\204\336\245\262\366a?2\373\020\326\235\265\201\252\234}\327v\362\264\204\342\255g;\205*\336\017\362\254\374>\315Zb#J\246\311\027\033\253\321,\aS\376\200V\317]\306ET\a\202\036X\365}\302a^\316\301qL\340\346\350T`QH\366@\374\317\300a\345p\245\000%\220\347q\360\254\266!\370\236U(\'\304K\234x\333\n\2563\206\354\347!\237\231\271\216\332;G\021\203\025\314K\207\232\325\002\025\357\a\036\366\035\245\351\271\204R\205\360\356\366\335\037\324\262-U\216\330\033s\242\344%\240\367JU\317\376\255\204\026wi\330\'\210~=\261\332k\312\322\274(\361\265\314\323\206\b\026\312s\"w\372\016k\2158\267\214 WI\203\351\230\356\025\006w\002\356\210x\362\302\206\250\035\301m\312\021\306\222\3430\202v\021O\336\342\307\340X\200\3752\022\255QD\263[X\303\215V\223\020y\370\357\033+%\300\300\363\346`\rg\274+\\n\373q\225\347u\"\235,\331&p\310\351\334\313\336\200\372<\022\331\365\342\235\243!\024,\341\3257\273\2026\337P\327\254\023`\2572r\017\207v\272xxx\322\322\n\3700\232%G~3vo\271M2\3651m\025!C\f\275\n\025\036V3J%W;\272#i\210a\3325*\005\253g~\251\030+\347v>~\240\352\325M\345?\210\251Q\201\031Tf\001\241\341\347\333)\364\034J\232 V\v5\ng\222\321\000M\221\334|\350\374\227\367\037\235H\325\362G\006\317e5\031\315\241\352P!I\361~\220\026\236 \266\257\222d:\025\221\372\357\222\242!y\214\a\227\370\035z\377\341\323\350\227/\371i\256\026G\002\273sf\301\267\221\200P\331:\001\234}\252x\256M\330KA\233\004\027\356\354z\224\231?ly\346x\351\375\023}sE\226f7\332\223\024`\376\374~\321\204Ry/\227\320\377\037}DZaX9\321\272\227\025\\\225U>\\\306\027|\t\225\203\250f\235\031+4\223]\326t\302\372\212\323\a\231\216&x4\342N\274[\306]\343\356\342\021\276a\004\'\364\034N\325\301Y\263/\356\263\004\362\247\236\251\016\327^\354\034\f\004\\\325u\031;\"\260\315\267\213\2531X5\001\266