  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Integrating Emergency Overlays**\n\nI\'m now integrating the emergency trigger overlay with the SOS page and home dashboard. Specifically, I\'m updating `EmergencyTriggerOverlay.tsx` to accept an optional `vehicleNumber`. When SOS triggers, the overlay will display this number, enhancing contextual information. This should ensure all three components function together smoothly, providing users with the data they need at the time of an emergency.\n\n\n**Enhancing Emergency Response**\n\nI\'m now focusing on automating emergency responses. Specifically, a secret voice code, screen taps, or a lock shield action will trigger `onDispatchSos`, which hits `/api/sos/dispatch` and logs dispatch messages. This also auto-calls guardians and police, and shows a confirmation with message previews, GPS, and one-tap communication links. The SOS page now shares live GPS with guardians and police, with share status and dispatch links.\n\n\n**Implementing Global Voice Control**\n\nI\'ve integrated the `VoiceController` at the `HomeDashboard` level for persistent AI voice functionality. This renders a persistent global AI voice bar at the top, showing live status and action options. My updates to `triggerSosAlert` now automatically POST to `/api/sos/dispatch` with travel mode details, GPS, guardians, and police information, and log automated dispatches. The `handleToggleLiveLocationShare` now shares location with guardians and police, and I\'ve added voice command handlers for travel mode, lock shield, and threat mode activation.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "_hIDa8jdF9yd-8YP0Nup8QU"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_3551410357554827924"
      name: "multi_replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"Description\":\"Enhance EmergencyTriggerOverlay to show automated call + guardian & police message dispatch with vehicle number & live GPS\", \"Instruction\":\"Accept optional vehicleNumber prop, include it in SMS payload, and clearly reflect automated call and guardian+police alert dispatch\", \"ReplacementChunks\":[{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":47, \"ReplacementContent\":\"interface EmergencyTriggerOverlayProps {\\n  event: QuickTriggerEvent;\\n  userName: string;\\n  contacts: SosContact[];\\n  geoLocation: GeoLocationState;\\n  nearestPolicePhone?: string;\\n  nearestPoliceName?: string;\\n  vehicleNumber?: string;\\n  countdownSeconds: 0 | 3;\\n  autoDialOnTrigger: boolean;\\n  onDispatchSos: (event: QuickTriggerEvent) => void;\\n  onOpenFullSosPage?: () => void;\\n  onClose: () => void;\\n}\\n\\nexport const EmergencyTriggerOverlay: React.FC<EmergencyTriggerOverlayProps> = ({\\n  event,\\n  userName,\\n  contacts,\\n  geoLocation,\\n  nearestPolicePhone,\\n  nearestPoliceName,\\n  vehicleNumber,\\n  countdownSeconds,\\n  autoDialOnTrigger,\\n  onDispatchSos,\\n  onOpenFullSosPage,\\n  onClose,\\n}) => {\", \"StartLine\":21, \"TargetContent\":\"interface EmergencyTriggerOverlayProps {\\n  event: QuickTriggerEvent;\\n  userName: string;\\n  contacts: SosContact[];\\n  geoLocation: GeoLocationState;\\n  nearestPolicePhone?: string;\\n  nearestPoliceName?: string;\\n  countdownSeconds: 0 | 3;\\n  autoDialOnTrigger: boolean;\\n  onDispatchSos: (event: QuickTriggerEvent) => void;\\n  onOpenFullSosPage?: () => void;\\n  onClose: () => void;\\n}\\n\\nexport const EmergencyTriggerOverlay: React.FC<EmergencyTriggerOverlayProps> = ({\\n  event,\\n  userName,\\n  contacts,\\n  geoLocation,\\n  nearestPolicePhone,\\n  nearestPoliceName,\\n  countdownSeconds,\\n  autoDialOnTrigger,\\n  onDispatchSos,\\n  onOpenFullSosPage,\\n  onClose,\\n}) => {\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":121, \"ReplacementContent\":\"  const smsBody = encodeURIComponent(\\n    `EMERGENCY SOS from ${userName} via OurSafe (${event.label})! Please call me immediately.${\\n      vehicleNumber ? ` Vehicle: ${vehicleNumber}.` : \'\'\\n    }${\\n      hasCoords\\n        ? ` Live GPS: https://maps.google.com/?q=${geoLocation.latitude!.toFixed(\\n            6\\n          )},${geoLocation.longitude!.toFixed(6)}`\\n        : \'\'\\n    }`\\n  );\", \"StartLine\":112, \"TargetContent\":\"  const smsBody = encodeURIComponent(\\n    `EMERGENCY SOS from ${userName} via OurSafe (${event.label})! Please call me immediately.${\\n      hasCoords\\n        ? ` Live GPS: https://maps.google.com/?q=${geoLocation.latitude!.toFixed(\\n            6\\n          )},${geoLocation.longitude!.toFixed(6)}`\\n        : \'\'\\n    }`\\n  );\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":231, \"ReplacementContent\":\"              {/* Live Dispatch Confirmation */}\\n              <div className=\\\"rounded-2xl bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 p-4 flex items-start gap-3\\\">\\n                <CheckCircle2 className=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-emerald-700 shrink-0 mt-0.5\\\" />\\n                <div className=\\\"text-xs space-y-1\\\">\\n                  <p className=\\\"font-bold text-emerald-950\\\">\\n                    Automatic Call + Guardian &amp; Police Alert Messages Dispatched\\n                  </p>\\n                  <p className=\\\"text-emerald-900/90 leading-relaxed\\\">\\n                    {autoDialAttempted\\n                      ? `Emergency call triggered automatically for ${\\n                          primaryGuardian\\n                            ? `${primaryGuardian.name} (${primaryGuardian.phone})`\\n                            : `Police (${policeNumber})`\\n                        }, and automated SOS alert messages with live GPS${\\n                          vehicleNumber ? ` & vehicle ${vehicleNumber}` : \'\'\\n                        } were dispatched to ${contacts.length} guardian(s) + Police (${policeNumber}).`\\n                      : `Automated SOS alert messages dispatched to ${contacts.length} guardian(s) + Police (${policeNumber}). Tap below to place direct calls anytime.`}\\n                  </p>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\", \"StartLine\":213, \"TargetContent\":\"              {/* Live Dispatch Confirmation */}\\n              <div className=\\\"rounded-2xl bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 p-4 flex items-start gap-3\\\">\\n                <CheckCircle2 className=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-emerald-700 shrink-0 mt-0.5\\\" />\\n                <div className=\\\"text-xs space-y-1\\\">\\n                  <p className=\\\"font-bold text-emerald-950\\\">\\n                    SOS Alert &amp; Emergency History Logged Automatically\\n                  </p>\\n                  <p className=\\\"text-emerald-900/90 leading-relaxed\\\">\\n                    {autoDialAttempted\\n                      ? `Phone dialer call triggered for ${\\n                          primaryGuardian\\n                            ? `${primaryGuardian.name} (${primaryGuardian.phone})`\\n                            : `Police (${policeNumber})`\\n                        }. Tap either emergency button below anytime to redial or call Police.`\\n                      : \'Tap either emergency button below to place direct calls to your guardian and police.\'}\\n                  </p>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\"}], \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/EmergencyTriggerOverlay.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Updating EmergencyTriggerOverlay with automated call and message dispatch\", \"toolSummary\":\"Update EmergencyTriggerOverlay.tsx\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\257\031\n\254\031\001i\024}\023\236e\373\260\v\374\025Z\251\016j\330\253\313uK\260&2e\000\311Y\327\366~\024]\021\332\017d-\226gB5l\337,\030D\315]\rT`\226\206\204c\367\200\335?\265\364xY\0301\237Z-\023\246\020\001dQ\301\231J\027>y\301\244\211\376z\374l\3175\251<\352\313\035\255\337L\3116w\017-E}\370\266\377!\316\304\251l$\f_7c\376\325\3120\222\225\377\377\304\r\031HY\210\335Z\365X7R\241g\200\376\324\005E\354\000\006\212\271\370P!\2024\337\341\326\303r\270@\275\205D\273\205\357\223\323,CE\352)\350\347V\321J\n\356\3367\370b\314\226\257\255\263\002OT\222=\250^d\rm\327\001\233D\253\232\b\334?JR\314\a\335`\316A\330{j\326\312w~kK\222\b\auO**\275He\241\233\237\275\033?\367V\352]\317\356\030\317\364\213)\260C\034\315@\367\263V\r\241)n/_Ad\321\354\316\271Mi\275 \216P3>\307/\334\v{\260\321z7\200\\\226RLH.\303\317\021\377\375\247H\354|\233q\3166\035J\320N\020[\201:\371\337H\023\241\271^</tyS\016\304T\362\374\"\254a\2050\352\252`\303\241&Cu\263\251\226\257\231kB\033\220\204\325\317\t\270\021\301\271\210$\342\a\320\310\274)\227H\336r\2079\274IIS4\364J\362+P\0302n\263\342\374s\3058\243\370\034\226v\342:\353>\303\255\367\366\037!\353\374\211\321\252Vi\v]\212c<4#RXO\265\272\211\027\032I6\312\032\232bg\233\257\004\255\303=\337&*\3335M\232\227\227\273\214\340C\245o\3071+\034\255N\327m\277\367\336Q\216GDH\360q\rO\002 \224\0206\032\025G\023r\213\025R\343\032r_}!\324>M?zkv\312\233\363;EC\262T\a\035\027ng\a\177\214\317\n\224H\030~5\033?\344\000\231\303\321\005\021\320jo\255\337VY\003\003\3052\'\212x\237[?Ns\362\355oM\271\361?\203\245\313\340:E\366\374q\024\347\313\220>\323\002\006F\303\224S\031\214\323z\035\203D\362]!@=]%\340\203\256\266|\370\261\324H\037B\0244h\2302\r>\316\370*^\273\225\332\003z[\221[)\215T\267\375\313\227:7~np\021\tM\351\240/\346\312\032d\260\203\243\313\225e\343\256\346d\344\227R\264_^\357\001\235\242\v\361z\204Q=\000[}\025yl\t\201\202\201\345\246}\215\346\275\311\336\372z\304Z\323\034:\205~\201`\351\224BG\335\271\317\246\376\016S\314:yH