  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining Dependencies**\n\nI\'ve made progress on cleaning up the code. The `TravelRouteMap.tsx` file is looking much better. I\'m focusing on creating local structural interfaces like `GmpLatLng` and `GmpPolyline` and a typed helper function. The goal is to avoid the need for `@types/google.maps` during type checking.\n\n\n"
