    thinking: "**Verifying Core API Routes**\n\nI\'m currently running a live curl smoke test against the backend APIs. I\'m verifying the `GET /api/health` endpoint and several POST routes: `POST /api/travel/verify-vehicle` (both valid and suspicious scenarios), `POST /api/sos/dispatch`, and `POST /api/threat/nearby-police`. The goal is to ensure all key routes are operational and responding as expected.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "PxYDa6P1EYnI-sAP-tXayA8"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_7672468662163140168"
