    user_response: "The created app is everything is fine, and now I\'m going to automate it. Voice assistants are if I\'m shaking the phone three times, it will call automatically without opening the app. If my phone is separated somewhere, I\'m saying red rose means it will call automatically SOS. In the phone lock screen, it wants to show, not the whole screen wants to captured. It wants to show just the icons, SOS icon or the app name in the lock screen. So it will the three safety system also on always. On-off method is in settings. The app is completely automated without opening the phone, without taking the phone. We can shake the phone without opening the phone. We can shake the phone. It will make call using secret code or using triple tap. It will want to share the live locations and the call also. Okay? And make the whole app a voice control. And make when I say our safe, this app was automatically run like a Google, and whole app was controlled by voice assistance. Okay? Add features on many ways and make the background perfectly placed."
    items {
      text: "The created app is everything is fine, and now I\'m going to automate it. Voice assistants are if I\'m shaking the phone three times, it will call automatically without opening the app. If my phone is separated somewhere, I\'m saying red rose means it will call automatically SOS. In the phone lock screen, it wants to show, not the whole screen wants to captured. It wants to show just the icons, SOS icon or the app name in the lock screen. So it will the three safety system also on always. On-off method is in settings. The app is completely automated without opening the phone, without taking the phone. We can shake the phone without opening the phone. We can shake the phone. It will make call using secret code or using triple tap. It will want to share the live locations and the call also. Okay? And make the whole app a voice control. And make when I say our safe, this app was automatically run like a Google, and whole app was controlled by voice assistance. Okay? Add features on many ways and make the background perfectly placed."
