  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing Emergency Triggers**\n\nI\'m now diving into the design of `useEmergencyQuickTriggers`. The focus is on implementing an always-on wake-word system with triple-safety features, and a minimal Android badge. This involves integrating `OurSafeBackgroundShieldService.kt` and `OurSafeShieldPlugin.kt` for native Android wake-word functionality.\n\n\n**Refining Wake Word Detection**\n\nI\'ve added an optional `onWakeWordDetected` callback to `EmergencyQuickTriggersOptions`. Now, in `evaluateSpokenPhrase`, the first check is for the Secret Emergency Code, like \"Red Rose,\" triggering SOS immediately. Then, if wake word is enabled, I\'m checking for the App Wake Word (variations like \"OurSafe\", \"ok oursafe\"). If matched, there\'s a chime and extraction of any follow-up command. Finally, it calls the callback.\n\n\n**Expanding Wake Word Functionality**\n\nI\'m now implementing `testWakeWord` on the returned state to enable wake-word testing on desktop without a microphone, using \"OurSafe\" as an example. I\'m also allowing `startVoiceWakeListener` when either voice activation or wake word is on, and ensuring the Web Speech recognition pauses gracefully when suspended. Lastly, I\'m adding `autoArmVoiceOnFirstGesture` to automatically start mic listening on the first user interaction, if voice activation or wake word is active, streamlining hands-free activation.\n\n\n**Implementing Native Trigger Actions**\n\nI\'m now integrating `wakeWordPhrase`, `lockScreenDisplayStyle`, and `autoShareLocationOnTrigger` into `OurSafeShieldPlugin.kt`. In `OurSafeBackgroundShieldService.kt`, I\'m checking both `secretVoiceCode` and `wakeWordPhrase` in `checkSpeechMatches`. When \"OurSafe\" is spoken with the phone locked, I want to wake the screen and launch `MainActivity`. I\'m also redesigning the Android lock-screen overlay to be a non-intrusive floating corner icon badge, and I\'ll send live GPS SMS and auto-dial when SOS triggers natively.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "DTsEa4D6BLbXz7IP9bLykQM"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_9405163852928917207"
      name: "multi_replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"Description\":\"Add Hey-Google style OurSafe wake-word detection, wake chime, follow-up command extraction, and seamless auto-resume when live voice suspends\", \"Instruction\":\"Upgrade useEmergencyQuickTriggers.ts with onWakeWordDetected callback, playWakeWordChime, OurSafe wake-word matching, testWakeWord helper, and automatic resume after suspension\", \"ReplacementChunks\":[{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":78, \"ReplacementContent\":\"export interface EmergencyQuickTriggersOptions {\\n  preferences: SafetyPreferences;\\n  /** True when full-screen Lock-Screen / Pocket Standby Shield is visible */\\n  isLockScreenActive: boolean;\\n  /** Temporarily pause global tap/voice capture when SOS overlay or AI Voice Live mic is active */\\n  suspended?: boolean;\\n  onTriggerSos: (event: QuickTriggerEvent) => void;\\n  /** Fired when the user says the \\\"OurSafe\\\" wake word (Hey-Google style hands-free launch) */\\n  onWakeWordDetected?: (payload: {\\n    spokenText: string;\\n    followUpCommand: string;\\n  }) => void;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface EmergencyQuickTriggersState {\\n  // 1. Shake state\\n  shakeCount: number;\\n  shakeSensorSupported: boolean;\\n  motionPermissionState: \'granted\' | \'prompt\' | \'denied\' | \'unsupported\';\\n  requestMotionPermission: () => Promise<boolean>;\\n  simulateShakeImpulse: () => void;\\n\\n  // 2. Voice Secret Code + \\\"OurSafe\\\" Wake Word state\\n  voiceSupported: boolean;\\n  voiceListening: boolean;\\n  voiceError: string;\\n  lastHeardTranscript: string;\\n  startVoiceWakeListener: () => void;\\n  stopVoiceWakeListener: () => void;\\n  toggleVoiceWakeListener: () => void;\\n  testSecretVoicePhrase: (spokenText: string) => {\\n    matched: boolean;\\n    normalizedHeard: string;\\n  };\\n  testWakeWordPhrase: (spokenText?: string) => {\\n    matched: boolean;\\n    followUpCommand: string;\\n  };\\n\\n  // 3. Screen Tap state\\n  tapCount: number;\\n  requiredTaps: 2 | 3;\\n\\n  // Screen Wake Lock (keeps Lock-Screen Standby Shield alive)\\n  wakeLockActive: boolean;\\n  requestWakeLock: () => Promise<boolean>;\\n  releaseWakeLock: () => Promise<void>;\\n}\", \"StartLine\":39, \"TargetContent\":\"export interface EmergencyQuickTriggersOptions {\\n  preferences: SafetyPreferences;\\n  /** True when full-screen Lock-Screen / Pocket Standby Shield is visible */\\n  isLockScreenActive: boolean;\\n  /** Temporarily pause global tap/voice capture when SOS overlay or AI Voice Live mic is active */\\n  suspended?: boolean;\\n  onTriggerSos: (event: QuickTriggerEvent) => void;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface EmergencyQuickTriggersState {\\n  // 1. Shake state\\n  shakeCount: number;\\n  shakeSensorSupported: boolean;\\n  motionPermissionState: \'granted\' | \'prompt\' | \'denied\' | \'unsupported\';\\n  requestMotionPermission: () => Promise<boolean>;\\n  simulateShakeImpulse: () => void;\\n\\n  // 2. Voice Secret Code state\\n  voiceSupported: boolean;\\n  voiceListening: boolean;\\n  voiceError: string;\\n  lastHeardTranscript: string;\\n  startVoiceWakeListener: () => void;\\n  stopVoiceWakeListener: () => void;\\n  toggleVoiceWakeListener: () => void;\\n  testSecretVoicePhrase: (spokenText: string) => {\\n    matched: boolean;\\n    normalizedHeard: string;\\n  };\\n\\n  // 3. Screen Tap state\\n  tapCount: number;\\n  requiredTaps: 2 | 3;\\n\\n  // Screen Wake Lock (keeps Lock-Screen Standby Shield alive)\\n  wakeLockActive: boolean;\\n  requestWakeLock: () => Promise<boolean>;\\n  releaseWakeLock: () => Promise<void>;\\n}\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":150, \"ReplacementContent\":\"export function playWakeWordChime() {\\n  try {\\n    const AudioCtx =\\n      window.AudioContext ||\\n      (window as unknown as { webkitAudioContext?: typeof AudioContext })\\n        .webkitAudioContext;\\n    if (!AudioCtx) return;\\n    const ctx = new AudioCtx();\\n    const now = ctx.currentTime;\\n    const notes = [523.25, 659.25, 783.99];\\n    notes.forEach((freq, idx) => {\\n      const osc = ctx.createOscillator();\\n      const gain = ctx.createGain();\\n      osc.type = \'sine\';\\n      osc.frequency.setValueAtTime(freq, now + idx * 0.08);\\n      gain.gain.setValueAtTime(0.001, now + idx * 0.08);\\n      gain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.11, now + idx * 0.08 + 0.02);\\n      gain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.001, now + idx * 0.08 + 0.14);\\n      osc.connect(gain);\\n      gain.connect(ctx.destination);\\n      osc.start(now + idx * 0.08);\\n      osc.stop(now + idx * 0.08 + 0.15);\\n    });\\n    window.setTimeout(() => {\\n      void ctx.close().catch(() => undefined);\\n    }, 500);\\n  } catch {\\n    // Ignore autoplay restriction\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nexport function useEmergencyQuickTriggers({\\n  preferences,\\n  isLockScreenActive,\\n  suspended = false,\\n  onTriggerSos,\\n  onWakeWordDetected,\\n}: EmergencyQuickTriggersOptions): EmergencyQuickTriggersState {\", \"StartLine\":143, \"TargetContent\":\"export function useEmergencyQuickTriggers({\\n  preferences,\\n  isLockScreenActive,\\n  suspended = false,\\n  onTriggerSos,\\n}: EmergencyQuickTriggersOptions): EmergencyQuickTriggersState {\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":205, \"ReplacementContent\":\"  const lastTriggerAtRef = useRef<number>(0);\\n  const lastWakeWordAtRef = useRef<number>(0);\\n  const shakeTimestampsRef = useRef<number[]>([]);\\n  const lastShakeImpulseRef = useRef<number>(0);\\n  const lastAccelRef = useRef<{ x: number; y: number; z: number } | null>(null);\\n  const shakeResetTimerRef = useRef<number | null>(null);\\n\\n  const tapRecordsRef = useRef<Array<{ time: number; x: number; y: number }>>([]);\\n  const tapResetTimerRef = useRef<number | null>(null);\\n\\n  const recognitionRef = useRef<BrowserSpeechRecognition | null>(null);\\n  const shouldKeepVoiceRunningRef = useRef<boolean>(false);\\n  const voiceRestartTimerRef = useRef<number | null>(null);\\n  const wakeLockRef = useRef<WakeLockSentinelLike | null>(null);\\n  const autoArmedGestureRef = useRef<boolean>(false);\\n\\n  const prefsRef = useRef(preferences);\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    prefsRef.current = preferences;\\n  }, [preferences]);\\n\\n  const lockScreenRef = useRef(isLockScreenActive);\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    lockScreenRef.current = isLockScreenActive;\\n  }, [isLockScreenActive]);\\n\\n  const suspendedRef = useRef(suspended);\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    suspendedRef.current = suspended;\\n  }, [suspended]);\\n\\n  const onTriggerRef = useRef(onTriggerSos);\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    onTriggerRef.current = onTriggerSos;\\n  }, [onTriggerSos]);\\n\\n  const onWakeWordRef = useRef(onWakeWordDetected);\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    onWakeWordRef.current = onWakeWordDetected;\\n  }, [onWakeWordDetected]);\", \"StartLine\":171, \"TargetContent\":\"  const lastTriggerAtRef = useRef<number>(0);\\n  const shakeTimestampsRef = useRef<number[]>([]);\\n  const lastShakeImpulseRef = useRef<number>(0);\\n  const lastAccelRef = useRef<{ x: number; y: number; z: number } | null>(null);\\n  const shakeResetTimerRef = useRef<number | null>(null);\\n\\n  const tapRecordsRef = useRef<Array<{ time: number; x: number; y: number }>>([]);\\n  const tapResetTimerRef = useRef<number | null>(null);\\n\\n  const recognitionRef = useRef<BrowserSpeechRecognition | null>(null);\\n  const shouldKeepVoiceRunningRef = useRef<boolean>(false);\\n  const voiceRestartTimerRef = useRef<number | null>(null);\\n  const wakeLockRef = useRef<WakeLockSentinelLike | null>(null);\\n\\n  const prefsRef = useRef(preferences);\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    prefsRef.current = preferences;\\n  }, [preferences]);\\n\\n  const lockScreenRef = useRef(isLockScreenActive);\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    lockScreenRef.current = isLockScreenActive;\\n  }, [isLockScreenActive]);\\n\\n  const suspendedRef = useRef(suspended);\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    suspendedRef.current = suspended;\\n  }, [suspended]);\\n\\n  const onTriggerRef = useRef(onTriggerSos);\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    onTriggerRef.current = onTriggerSos;\\n  }, [onTriggerSos]);\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":395, \"ReplacementContent\":\"  // ==========================================================\\n  // 2. ALWAYS-ON SECRET CODE + \\\"OURSAFE\\\" WAKE WORD LISTENER (\\\"Hey Google\\\" Style)\\n  // ==========================================================\\n  const matchWakeWordAndExtract = useCallback(\\n    (normalizedHeard: string): { matched: boolean; followUpCommand: string } => {\\n      const rawWake = prefsRef.current.wakeWordPhrase?.trim() || \'OurSafe\';\\n      const normalizedWake = normalizeText(rawWake);\\n      const candidates = [\\n        normalizedWake,\\n        \'our safe\',\\n        \'oursafe\',\\n        \'hey oursafe\',\\n        \'hey our safe\',\\n        \'ok oursafe\',\\n        \'ok our safe\',\\n        \'hour safe\',\\n        \'are safe\',\\n      ].filter(Boolean);\\n\\n      for (const candidate of candidates) {\\n        const idx = normalizedHeard.indexOf(candidate);\\n        if (idx !== -1) {\\n          const after = normalizedHeard.slice(idx + candidate.length).trim();\\n          return { matched: true, followUpCommand: after };\\n        }\\n      }\\n\\n      const compactHeard = normalizedHeard.replace(/\\\\s+/g, \'\');\\n      const compactWake = normalizedWake.replace(/\\\\s+/g, \'\');\\n      if (compactWake && compactHeard.includes(compactWake)) {\\n        return { matched: true, followUpCommand: \'\' };\\n      }\\n      return { matched: false, followUpCommand: \'\' };\\n    },\\n    []\\n  );\\n\\n  const evaluateSpokenPhrase = useCallback(\\n    (spokenText: string): { matched: boolean; normalizedHeard: string } => {\\n      const normalizedHeard = normalizeText(spokenText);\\n      const rawCode = prefsRef.current.voiceKeyword.trim() || \'Red Rose\';\\n      const normalizedCode = normalizeText(rawCode);\\n\\n      setLastHeardTranscript(spokenText.trim());\\n\\n      if (!normalizedHeard) {\\n        return { matched: false, normalizedHeard };\\n      }\\n\\n      // Priority 1: Emergency Secret Code (\\\"Red Rose\\\") -> Instant SOS Call + Live GPS Share\\n      if (normalizedCode && prefsRef.current.voiceActivationEnabled && !suspendedRef.current) {\\n        const compactHeard = normalizedHeard.replace(/\\\\s+/g, \'\');\\n        const compactCode = normalizedCode.replace(/\\\\s+/g, \'\');\\n        const matchedCode =\\n          normalizedHeard.includes(normalizedCode) ||\\n          compactHeard.includes(compactCode);\\n\\n        if (matchedCode) {\\n          fireSosTrigger(\\n            \'voice_code\',\\n            `Secret Voice Code (\\\"${rawCode}\\\")`,\\n            `Heard secret emergency phrase \\\"${spokenText.trim()}\\\" matching code \\\"${rawCode}\\\". Automatically calling SOS & sharing live location.`\\n          );\\n          return { matched: true, normalizedHeard };\\n        }\\n      }\\n\\n      // Priority 2: \\\"OurSafe\\\" Wake Word (Hey-Google style app launch & full voice control)\\n      if (prefsRef.current.wakeWordEnabled && !suspendedRef.current && onWakeWordRef.current) {\\n        const wakeCheck = matchWakeWordAndExtract(normalizedHeard);\\n        if (wakeCheck.matched) {\\n          const now = Date.now();\\n          if (now - lastWakeWordAtRef.current > 2400) {\\n            lastWakeWordAtRef.current = now;\\n            triggerHapticPattern([60, 40, 80]);\\n            playWakeWordChime();\\n            onWakeWordRef.current({\\n              spokenText: spokenText.trim(),\\n              followUpCommand: wakeCheck.followUpCommand,\\n            });\\n          }\\n          return { matched: true, normalizedHeard };\\n        }\\n      }\\n\\n      return { matched: false, normalizedHeard };\\n    },\\n    [fireSosTrigger, matchWakeWordAndExtract]\\n  );\\n\\n  const testWakeWordPhrase = useCallback(\\n    (spokenText?: string): { matched: boolean; followUpCommand: string } => {\\n      const phrase =\\n        spokenText?.trim() ||\\n        prefsRef.current.wakeWordPhrase?.trim() ||\\n        \'OurSafe\';\\n      const normalized = normalizeText(phrase);\\n      const wakeCheck = matchWakeWordAndExtract(normalized);\\n      if (wakeCheck.matched && prefsRef.current.wakeWordEnabled && onWakeWordRef.current) {\\n        lastWakeWordAtRef.current = Date.now();\\n        triggerHapticPattern([60, 40, 80]);\\n        playWakeWordChime();\\n        onWakeWordRef.current({\\n          spokenText: phrase,\\n          followUpCommand: wakeCheck.followUpCommand,\\n        });\\n      }\\n      return wakeCheck;\\n    },\\n    [matchWakeWordAndExtract]\\n  );\\n\\n  const stopVoiceWakeListener = useCallback(() => {\\n    shouldKeepVoiceRunningRef.current = false;\\n    if (voiceRestartTimerRef.current !== null) {\\n      window.clearTimeout(voiceRestartTimerRef.current);\\n      voiceRestartTimerRef.current = null;\\n    }\\n    if (recognitionRef.current) {\\n      try {\\n        recognitionRef.current.onend = null;\\n        recognitionRef.current.stop();\\n      } catch {\\n        // Ignore\\n      }\\n      recognitionRef.current = null;\\n    }\\n    setVoiceListening(false);\\n  }, []);\\n\\n  const startVoiceWakeListener = useCallback(() => {\\n    const Ctor = getSpeechRecognitionCtor();\\n    if (!Ctor) {\\n      setVoiceError(\\n        \'Continuous browser speech recognition works best in Chrome, Edge, or Android browsers. Use the Voice Test buttons anytime.\'\\n      );\\n      return;\\n    }\\n\\n    if (\\n      !prefsRef.current.voiceActivationEnabled &&\\n      !prefsRef.current.wakeWordEnabled\\n    ) {\\n      setVoiceError(\'Enable Secret Voice Code or \\\"OurSafe\\\" Wake Word in Settings first.\');\\n      return;\\n    }\\n\\n    setVoiceError(\'\');\\n    shouldKeepVoiceRunningRef.current = true;\", \"StartLine\":326, \"TargetContent\":\"  // ==========================================================\\n  // 2. ALWAYS-ON SECRET CODE VOICE WAKE LISTENER (\\\"Hey Google\\\" Style)\\n  // ==========================================================\\n  const evaluateSpokenPhrase = useCallback(\\n    (spokenText: string): { matched: boolean; normalizedHeard: string } => {\\n      const normalizedHeard = normalizeText(spokenText);\\n      const rawCode = prefsRef.current.voiceKeyword.trim() || \'Red Rose\';\\n      const normalizedCode = normalizeText(rawCode);\\n\\n      setLastHeardTranscript(spokenText.trim());\\n\\n      if (!normalizedHeard || !normalizedCode) {\\n        return { matched: false, normalizedHeard };\\n      }\\n\\n      // Support exact phrase match OR compact match (ignoring spaces, e.g. \\\"redrose\\\" vs \\\"red rose\\\")\\n      const compactHeard = normalizedHeard.replace(/\\\\s+/g, \'\');\\n      const compactCode = normalizedCode.replace(/\\\\s+/g, \'\');\\n\\n      const matched =\\n        normalizedHeard.includes(normalizedCode) ||\\n        compactHeard.includes(compactCode);\\n\\n      if (matched && prefsRef.current.voiceActivationEnabled && !suspendedRef.current) {\\n        fireSosTrigger(\\n          \'voice_code\',\\n          `Secret Voice Code (\\\"${rawCode}\\\")`,\\n          `Heard secret emergency phrase \\\"${spokenText.trim()}\\\" matching code \\\"${rawCode}\\\". Initiating emergency SOS call.`\\n        );\\n      }\\n\\n      return { matched, normalizedHeard };\\n    },\\n    [fireSosTrigger]\\n  );\\n\\n  const stopVoiceWakeListener = useCallback(() => {\\n    shouldKeepVoiceRunningRef.current = false;\\n    if (voiceRestartTimerRef.current !== null) {\\n      window.clearTimeout(voiceRestartTimerRef.current);\\n      voiceRestartTimerRef.current = null;\\n    }\\n    if (recognitionRef.current) {\\n      try {\\n        recognitionRef.current.onend = null;\\n        recognitionRef.current.stop();\\n      } catch {\\n        // Ignore\\n      }\\n      recognitionRef.current = null;\\n    }\\n    setVoiceListening(false);\\n  }, []);\\n\\n  const startVoiceWakeListener = useCallback(() => {\\n    const Ctor = getSpeechRecognitionCtor();\\n    if (!Ctor) {\\n      setVoiceError(\\n        \'Continuous browser speech recognition works best in Chrome, Edge, or Android browsers. Use the Secret Code Voice Test below anytime.\'\\n      );\\n      return;\\n    }\\n\\n    if (!prefsRef.current.voiceActivationEnabled) {\\n      setVoiceError(\'Enable Secret Voice Code SOS first.\');\\n      return;\\n    }\\n\\n    setVoiceError(\'\');\\n    shouldKeepVoiceRunningRef.current = true;\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":495, \"ReplacementContent\":\"        rec.onend = () => {\\n          if (\\n            shouldKeepVoiceRunningRef.current &&\\n            (prefsRef.current.voiceActivationEnabled ||\\n              prefsRef.current.wakeWordEnabled) &&\\n            !suspendedRef.current\\n          ) {\\n            voiceRestartTimerRef.current = window.setTimeout(() => {\\n              launchInstance();\\n            }, 350);\\n          } else {\\n            setVoiceListening(false);\\n          }\\n        };\\n\\n        recognitionRef.current = rec;\\n        rec.start();\\n      } catch {\\n        setVoiceListening(false);\\n      }\\n    };\\n\\n    if (recognitionRef.current) {\\n      try {\\n        recognitionRef.current.onend = null;\\n        recognitionRef.current.stop();\\n      } catch {\\n        // Ignore\\n      }\\n      recognitionRef.current = null;\\n    }\\n\\n    launchInstance();\\n  }, [evaluateSpokenPhrase]);\\n\\n  const toggleVoiceWakeListener = useCallback(() => {\\n    if (voiceListening || shouldKeepVoiceRunningRef.current) {\\n      stopVoiceWakeListener();\\n    } else {\\n      startVoiceWakeListener();\\n    }\\n  }, [voiceListening, startVoiceWakeListener, stopVoiceWakeListener]);\\n\\n  // Pause mic cleanly when both voice features are disabled or suspended, and auto-resume when unsuspended\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    const anyVoiceEnabled =\\n      preferences.voiceActivationEnabled || preferences.wakeWordEnabled;\\n\\n    if (!anyVoiceEnabled || suspended) {\\n      if (recognitionRef.current) {\\n        try {\\n          recognitionRef.current.onend = null;\\n          recognitionRef.current.stop();\\n        } catch {\\n          // Ignore\\n        }\\n        recognitionRef.current = null;\\n      }\\n      setVoiceListening(false);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n\\n    if (shouldKeepVoiceRunningRef.current && !recognitionRef.current) {\\n      startVoiceWakeListener();\\n    }\\n  }, [\\n    preferences.voiceActivationEnabled,\\n    preferences.wakeWordEnabled,\\n    suspended,\\n    startVoiceWakeListener,\\n  ]);\\n\\n  // Auto-arm always-on voice wake listener on first user gesture if voice safety is enabled\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    const anyVoiceEnabled =\\n      preferences.voiceActivationEnabled || preferences.wakeWordEnabled;\\n    if (!anyVoiceEnabled || !voiceSupported || suspended) return;\\n    if (autoArmedGestureRef.current) return;\\n\\n    const handleFirstGesture = () => {\\n      if (autoArmedGestureRef.current) return;\\n      autoArmedGestureRef.current = true;\\n      if (\\n        !shouldKeepVoiceRunningRef.current &&\\n        !suspendedRef.current &&\\n        (prefsRef.current.voiceActivationEnabled || prefsRef.current.wakeWordEnabled)\\n      ) {\\n        startVoiceWakeListener();\\n      }\\n    };\\n\\n    window.addEventListener(\'pointerdown\', handleFirstGesture, { once: true, passive: true });\\n    return () => {\\n      window.removeEventListener(\'pointerdown\', handleFirstGesture);\\n    };\\n  }, [\\n    preferences.voiceActivationEnabled,\\n    preferences.wakeWordEnabled,\\n    voiceSupported,\\n    suspended,\\n    startVoiceWakeListener,\\n  ]);\", \"StartLine\":436, \"TargetContent\":\"        rec.onend = () => {\\n          if (\\n            shouldKeepVoiceRunningRef.current &&\\n            prefsRef.current.voiceActivationEnabled &&\\n            !suspendedRef.current\\n          ) {\\n            voiceRestartTimerRef.current = window.setTimeout(() => {\\n              launchInstance();\\n            }, 350);\\n          } else {\\n            setVoiceListening(false);\\n          }\\n        };\\n\\n        recognitionRef.current = rec;\\n        rec.start();\\n      } catch {\\n        setVoiceListening(false);\\n      }\\n    };\\n\\n    if (recognitionRef.current) {\\n      try {\\n        recognitionRef.current.onend = null;\\n        recognitionRef.current.stop();\\n      } catch {\\n        // Ignore\\n      }\\n      recognitionRef.current = null;\\n    }\\n\\n    launchInstance();\\n  }, [evaluateSpokenPhrase]);\\n\\n  const toggleVoiceWakeListener = useCallback(() => {\\n    if (voiceListening || shouldKeepVoiceRunningRef.current) {\\n      stopVoiceWakeListener();\\n    } else {\\n      startVoiceWakeListener();\\n    }\\n  }, [voiceListening, startVoiceWakeListener, stopVoiceWakeListener]);\\n\\n  // Stop mic cleanly when voice trigger is disabled or suspended\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    if (!preferences.voiceActivationEnabled || suspended) {\\n      if (recognitionRef.current) {\\n        try {\\n          recognitionRef.current.onend = null;\\n          recognitionRef.current.stop();\\n        } catch {\\n          // Ignore\\n        }\\n        recognitionRef.current = null;\\n      }\\n      setVoiceListening(false);\\n    }\\n  }, [preferences.voiceActivationEnabled, suspended]);\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":651, \"ReplacementContent\":\"    toggleVoiceWakeListener,\\n    testSecretVoicePhrase: evaluateSpokenPhrase,\\n    testWakeWordPhrase,\\n    tapCount,\\n    requiredTaps: preferences.screenTapCount === 2 ? 2 : 3,\\n    wakeLockActive,\\n    requestWakeLock,\\n    releaseWakeLock,\\n  };\\n}\", \"StartLine\":642, \"TargetContent\":\"    toggleVoiceWakeListener,\\n    testSecretVoicePhrase: evaluateSpokenPhrase,\\n    tapCount,\\n    requiredTaps: preferences.screenTapCount === 2 ? 2 : 3,\\n    wakeLockActive,\\n    requestWakeLock,\\n    releaseWakeLock,\\n  };\\n}\"}], \"TargetFile\":\"/src/hooks/useEmergencyQuickTriggers.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Adding OurSafe wake word and auto-arm voice engine\", \"toolSummary\":\"Upgrade useEmergencyQuickTriggers.ts\"}"
