    session_summary: "<summary>\n### 1. Task Overview\nThe user requested full hands-free automation and visual refinement for **OurSafe** (Women Safety Companion \342\200\224 React + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS v4 + Express + Gemini Live/Hydrogen + VitePWA + Capacitor Android Native):\n1. **Minimal Phone Lock-Screen Icon Overlay (NOT Full-Screen Capture)**: On the phone lock screen, do NOT capture/cover the entire screen. Show only a compact floating SOS icon OR compact `SOS \302\267 OurSafe` badge (configurable in Settings), leaving the lock screen clean and unobstructed.\n2. **All 3 Safety Systems Always-On (with ON/OFF Controls in Settings)**:\n   - `3x Phone Shake` (works without opening the app)\n   - `Secret Voice Code (\"Red Rose\")` (works even when the phone is across the room)\n   - `Triple/Double Screen Tap` (2x/3x configurable)\n   - Must automatically **place the emergency call AND share live GPS location** (Guardians + Police) on trigger.\n   - Clean ON/OFF switches (plus Master All ON / All OFF) inside Settings.\n3. **\"Hey Google\"-Style `\"OurSafe\"` Voice Wake Word + Whole-App Voice Control**:\n   - Saying **\"OurSafe\"** automatically wakes/runs the app like \"Hey Google\" and activates full voice control across every screen (with instant follow-up command execution like *\"OurSafe open SOS\"*, *\"OurSafe activate threat mode\"*, *\"OurSafe share my location\"*, *\"OurSafe open travel mode\"*, *\"OurSafe find police\"*, *\"OurSafe open settings\"*).\n   - Provide a persistent floating voice assistant orb accessible on every page.\n4. **Perfectly Placed Background & Polish**:\n   - Replace the flat solid `#CDD7C1` canvas background with a calm, viewport-anchored botanical layered canvas (`.oursafe-canvas-bg`) across Login, Signup, and Dashboard, and a realistic twilight lock-screen wallpaper (`.oursafe-lock-wallpaper`) on Lock Shield.\n   - Clean up any remaining `\"Sample Reviews\"` wording on HomeAboutPage and surface an Always-On Automation readiness strip on Home.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Progress\n\n#### Completed Edits (Not Yet Compiled/Linted After Batch 1\342\200\2233)\n1. **Batch 1 \342\200\224 Types, Storage, Native Bridge & Background CSS (COMPLETED)**:\n   - `/src/types/safety.ts`: Extended `SafetyPreferences` with `wakeWordEnabled: boolean`, `wakeWordPhrase: string`, `lockScreenDisplayStyle: \'icon_only\' | \'icon_and_name\'`, and `autoShareLocationOnTrigger: boolean`.\n   - `/src/utils/storage.ts`: Added new always-on defaults (`wakeWordEnabled: true`, `wakeWordPhrase: \'OurSafe\'`, `lockScreenDisplayStyle: \'icon_and_name\'`, `autoShareLocationOnTrigger: true`, `quickTriggerCountdownSec: 0`) in `DEFAULT_PREFERENCES` and `hydrateUser`.\n   - `/src/utils/nativeShieldBridge.ts`: Synced `wakeWordEnabled`, `wakeWordPhrase`, `lockScreenDisplayStyle`, and `autoShareLocationOnTrigger` in `NativeShieldSyncPayload` & `buildNativeSyncPayload`.\n   - `/src/index.css`: Added `.oursafe-canvas-bg` (viewport-anchored soft radial sage/ivory blooms + 24px subtle dot matrix) and `.oursafe-lock-wallpaper` (authentic twilight phone lock screen backdrop).\n\n2. **Batch 2 \342\200\224 Wake-Word Engine & Android Native Shield (COMPLETED)**:\n   - `/src/hooks/useEmergencyQuickTriggers.ts`:\n     - Added `onWakeWordDetected?: (payload: { spokenText: string; followUpCommand: string }) => void` option.\n     - Added `playWakeWordChime()` gentle 3-note chime.\n     - Upgraded `evaluateSpokenPhrase()` so Priority 1 matches Secret Emergency Code (`\"Red Rose\"`) -> instant SOS trigger, and Priority 2 matches `\"OurSafe\"` wake word (including variants `\"our safe\"`, `\"hey oursafe\"`, `\"ok oursafe\"`, `\"hour safe\"`, `\"are safe\"`) -> extracts `followUpCommand` and fires `onWakeWordDetected`.\n     - Added `testWakeWordPhrase(spokenText?)` helper to returned state.\n     - Updated mic auto-pause/auto-resume when `suspended` toggles (so wake-word mic cleanly yields to Gemini Live Voice mic and resumes automatically when Live Voice closes), AND added one-time `pointerdown` auto-arming so always-on voice listening activates automatically on first user gesture.\n   - `/android-native/OurSafeShieldPlugin.kt`: Persisted `wakeWordEnabled`, `wakeWordPhrase`, `lockScreenDisplayStyle`, and `autoShareLocationOnTrigger` into `SharedPreferences`.\n   - `/android-native/OurSafeBackgroundShieldService.kt`:\n     - Upgraded speech loop to also match `\"OurSafe\"` wake word and launch `MainActivity` with `oursafe_voice_wake = true` (Hey-Google style).\n     - Redesigned `attachLockAndHomeOverlayShield()` so the Android `TYPE_APPLICATION_OVERLAY` is a tiny rounded pill/circle at `Gravity.BOTTOM | Gravity.END` showing ONLY `\"SOS\"` (`icon_only`) or `\"SOS \302\267 OurSafe\"` (`icon_and_name`) \342\200\224 never capturing the full screen.\n\n3. **Batch 3 \342\200\224 Minimal Lock Screen, Settings ON/OFF Center & Quick Triggers Card (COMPLETED)**:\n   - `/src/components/EmergencyLockScreenShield.tsx`: Completely redesigned so the Phone Lock Screen & Home Screen remain clean and unobstructed (no big card grid taking over the lock screen!). Displays ONLY the minimal floating bottom-right SOS icon (circular red SOS shield in `icon_only` mode or compact `SOS \302\267 OurSafe` pill in `icon_and_name` mode) + quiet bottom-left Unlock & `\"Test / Switch\"` drawer button containing Shake / `\"Red Rose\"` / `\"OurSafe\"` wake-word tests.\n   - `/src/components/dashboard/SettingsModal.tsx`: Added `\"Always-On Safety Systems (On / Off)\"` section with `All ON` / `All OFF` buttons, individual switches for `1. 3x Phone Shake SOS`, `2. Secret Voice Code SOS`, `3. Screen Triple/Double Tap SOS`, `\"OurSafe\" Hands-Free App Wake Word` (with editable phrase), `Auto-Call & Share Live GPS on Trigger`, and `Phone Lock-Screen Display Style` (`SOS Icon Only` vs `SOS Icon + OurSafe Name`).\n   - `/src/components/dashboard/QuickSosTriggersCard.tsx`: Updated header copy and added a `\"Say \'OurSafe\'\"` test button alongside `\"Lock Icon Preview\"` and `\"Home Screen\"`.\n\n#### Remaining Edits (Batch 4 \342\200\224 NOT YET DONE)\n- `/src/components/HomeDashboard.tsx` \342\200\224 Wire `onWakeWordDetected`, suspend `useEmergencyQuickTriggers` while `voiceController.liveStatus === \'connected\' || voiceController.liveStatus === \'connecting\'` so the two microphones never collide, auto-start `handleToggleLiveLocationShare(true, 30)` inside `handleDispatchQuickTriggerSos` when `autoShareLocationOnTrigger !== false`, add instant local + Gemini follow-up command routing on `\"OurSafe\"` wake, add a persistent floating bottom-right `\"OurSafe Voice\"` orb across all pages, and apply `.oursafe-canvas-bg` to the root container.\n- `/src/App.tsx` \342\200\224 Wire `onWakeWordDetected` on `preLoginTriggers` (when logged out or on pre-login Lock Shield, saying `\"OurSafe\"` closes Lock Shield and signs into or alerts the user to voice-control mode; also support `?mode=voicewake` URL query), and ensure `preLoginTriggers` dispatches live GPS + call cleanly.\n- `/src/components/LoginScreen.tsx` & `/src/components/SignupScreen.tsx` \342\200\224 Replace flat `bg-[#CDD7C1]` root wrapper with `oursafe-canvas-bg` so the background is perfectly placed across every screen, and show `\"OurSafe\"` wake-word readiness in the pre-login strip.\n- `/src/components/pages/HomeAboutPage.tsx` \342\200\224 Replace `\"Clearly Labelled Sample Reviews\"` with `\"Community Reviews\"`, and add a compact, high-clarity `\"Always-On Hands-Free Protection\"` summary row in the Home hero showing the live status of 3x Shake, `\"Red Rose\"`, 3x Tap, and `\"OurSafe\"` wake word (with quick button to open Settings / Lock Icon Preview).\n- `/server.ts` \342\200\224 Optionally add `\"open_settings\"` tool to `SAFETY_VOICE_TOOLS` + `HomeDashboard.tsx` voice executor so saying `\"OurSafe open settings\"` works by voice too!\n\n---\n\n### 3. Key Findings\n- **Microphone Exclusivity (CRITICAL)**: Browser Web Speech Recognition (`useEmergencyQuickTriggers`) and `getUserMedia` PCM streaming (`useGlobalVoiceController` -> Gemini Live) should not hold conflicting mic capture simultaneously on mobile browsers. Passing `suspended: Boolean(activeQuickTriggerEvent) || voiceController.liveStatus === \'connected\' || voiceController.liveStatus === \'connecting\'` to `useEmergencyQuickTriggers` makes the wake-word listener yield cleanly the moment `\"OurSafe\"` wakes up Gemini Live Voice, and automatically resume the instant Gemini Live Voice disconnects!\n- **Automatic Live Location Sharing on All 3 Triggers**: Previously, `handleDispatchQuickTriggerSos` called `triggerSosAlert` + `openDualCall` (which sent one-shot `/api/sos/dispatch` + `tel:`), but did NOT activate continuous `liveLocationShare`. Calling `handleToggleLiveLocationShare(true, 30)` when `user.preferences.autoShareLocationOnTrigger !== false` ensures continuous live GPS sharing with Guardians & Police turns ON automatically whenever 3x Shake, `\"Red Rose\"`, or Triple Tap fires.\n- **Prior Verified Baseline**: Earlier in this session, Vite 8 WebSocket (`server.ws = { server }` + `noServer: true` on `/api/live-voice` in `server.ts`), Google Maps (`@vis.gl/react-google-maps` + Routes API), Threat Mode auto-recording, Vehicle verification (`/api/travel/verify-vehicle`), SOS dispatch (`/api/sos/dispatch`), and Nearby Police AI (`/api/threat/nearby-police`) were all built, verified, and passing with 0 TypeScript or build errors.\n\n---\n\n### 4. Errors & Fixes (Earlier in Session \342\200\224 All Resolved)\n- **Resolved earlier**: `TravelRouteMap.tsx` had `Cannot find namespace \'google\'` in `tsc --noEmit` -> fixed with local structural interfaces (`GmpLatLng`, `GmpPolyline`, `GmpLatLngBounds`).\n- **Resolved earlier**: `[vite] Error: WebSocket closed without opened.` on `@vite/client` -> fixed in `/server.ts` by switching `WebSocketServer` for `/api/live-voice` to `{ noServer: true }` with selective `server.on(\'upgrade\')`, and passing `ws: { server }` to `createViteServer({ server: { middlewareMode: true, ws: { server } }, appType: \'spa\' })`. Verified live that both `VITE_WS` and `LIVE_VOICE_WS` open cleanly on port 3000.\n- **Current edits (Batch 1\342\200\2233)**: Not yet compiled/linted; will verify cleanly once Batch 4 finishes.\n\n---\n\n### 5. Active Context\n- Dev server is running on port 3000 (`tsx server.ts`).\n- `HomeDashboard.tsx` (lines 1\342\200\2232154), `App.tsx` (lines 1\342\200\223266), `LoginScreen.tsx` (lines 1\342\200\223762), `SignupScreen.tsx` (root lines 245 & 302), and `HomeAboutPage.tsx` (lines 1\342\200\223759) have all been inspected and are ready for surgical edits.\n- Do NOT touch Google Maps provisioning tools (Maps key is already live and working).\n\n---\n\n### 6. Next Steps (Execute Immediately in Order)\n1. **Update `/src/components/HomeDashboard.tsx`**:\n   - Add `open_settings` case in `handleExecuteVoiceCommand` (`setActiveModal(\'settings\')`).\n   - Add `handleWakeWordDetected` callback:\n     - Closes `lockScreenShieldOpen` if open (bringing OurSafe straight to the front like \"Hey Google\"!).\n     - Shows toast (`\"OurSafe Voice Activated \342\200\224 Listening...\"`).\n     - If `followUpCommand` is present, routes instant voice intents or calls `voiceController.runTextCommand(followUpCommand)` immediately (AND starts `voiceController.startLiveVoice()` if online and not already connected so continuous whole-app voice control stays live!).\n     - If no `followUpCommand`, immediately starts `voiceController.startLiveVoice()` (falling back gracefully to navigating to `\'assistant\'` if mic/network unavailable).\n   - Also check URL `?mode=voicewake` on mount to auto-launch Live Voice.\n   - Update `useEmergencyQuickTriggers` call in `HomeDashboard.tsx`:\n     - Set `suspended: Boolean(activeQuickTriggerEvent) || voiceController.liveStatus === \'connected\' || voiceController.liveStatus === \'connecting\'`\n     - Pass `onWakeWordDetected: handleWakeWordDetected`.\n   - Update `handleDispatchQuickTriggerSos`:\n     - When `user.preferences.autoShareLocationOnTrigger !== false`, also call `handleToggleLiveLocationShare(true, 30)` so live GPS location sharing activates automatically alongside the emergency call!\n   - Replace `bg-[#CDD7C1]` on the root `<div>` (line 1539) with `oursafe-canvas-bg`.\n   - Update the persistent voice banner (lines 1731\342\200\2231770) to also indicate `\"OurSafe\"` wake word listening.\n   - Add a sleek, compact floating bottom-right **\"OurSafe Voice\"** circular button (`fixed right-4 bottom-[74px] lg:bottom-6 z-40`, `data-ignore-sos-tap=\"true\"`) that toggles `voiceController.startLiveVoice()` / `disconnectLiveVoice()` from ANY page with pulsing ring when active!\n   - Pass `preferences={user.preferences}`, `voiceListening={quickTriggers.voiceListening}`, `onOpenSettings={() => setActiveModal(\'settings\')}`, `onOpenLockShield={() => openLockAndHomeShield(\'lock_screen\')}`, `onWakeVoice={() => handleWakeWordDetected({ spokenText: user.preferences.wakeWordPhrase || \'OurSafe\', followUpCommand: \'\' })}` to `HomeAboutPage`.\n2. **Update `/src/App.tsx`**:\n   - Pass `onWakeWordDetected` into `preLoginTriggers`: closes `preLoginLockShieldOpen`, logs in the saved emergency profile (`handleLoginSuccess(fallbackUser)`) or launches with `?mode=voicewake` equivalent so saying `\"OurSafe\"` from the Login/Lock screen automatically opens OurSafe into hands-free voice mode just like \"Hey Google\"!\n   - Support an optional `autoStartVoice` prop on `HomeDashboard` so waking from Login/Lock Shield starts full-app voice control immediately!\n3. **Update `/src/components/LoginScreen.tsx` & `/src/components/SignupScreen.tsx`**:\n   - Replace `bg-[#CDD7C1]` root wrappers with `oursafe-canvas-bg`.\n   - In `LoginScreen.tsx` pre-login readiness strip, also display `Say \"OurSafe\" (Voice App)` alongside `3x Shake`, `Say \"Red Rose\"`, and `Triple-Tap Screen`.\n4. **Update `/src/components/pages/HomeAboutPage.tsx`**:\n   - Replace `\"Clearly Labelled Sample Reviews\"` with `\"Community Reviews\"`.\n   - Add a clean `\"Always-On Automation Active\"` status bar inside the Hero card showing the 4 hands-free triggers (`3x Shake`, `Say \"Red Rose\"`, `Triple Tap`, `Say \"OurSafe\"`) with direct `\"Settings (On/Off)\"` and `\"Lock Icon\"` links.\n5. **Update `/server.ts`**:\n   - Add `open_settings` tool to `SAFETY_VOICE_TOOLS` and mention `\"OurSafe\"` wake-word + Settings voice navigation in `buildSystemInstruction`.\n6. **Final Verification**:\n   - Co-execute `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` together until both pass with 0 errors.\n   - Run `restart_dev_server` if `/server.ts` was updated, then curl-check `http://localhost:3000/` and `http://localhost:3000/api/health`.\n   - Present a clear, concise summary of all completed features.\n\n---\n\n### 7. Commitments & Constraints\n- Never call Google Maps provisioning tools again.\n- Never rename `metadata.json`.\n- Keep all UI clean (no system logs/telemetry dumps, no `window.alert`/`window.open`, no fabricated police/vehicle data).\n- Always run `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` together before concluding.\n</summary>"
