  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Executing Parallel Edits**\n\nI\'m ready to move forward. My focus has shifted to making the Batch 4 edits simultaneously. Specifically, I intend to apply the updates in parallel across these files: `/src/components/HomeDashboard.tsx`, `/src/App.tsx`, `/src/components/LoginScreen.tsx` and `/src/components/SignupScreen.tsx`. I believe this strategy will be most efficient.\n\n\n**Expanding Voice Features**\n\nMy focus has broadened to include `/src/components/pages/HomeAboutPage.tsx` and `/server.ts`. I\'m meticulously reviewing the changes for the core files: `/src/components/HomeDashboard.tsx` now integrates `autoStartVoice` and `onConsumeAutoStartVoice`, alongside enhanced voice command handling. I\'m also adding logic for `handleWakeWordDetected`, which should streamline the user experience, while keeping an eye on how `/server.ts` handles the voice processing backend.\n\n\n**Refining Emergency Triggers**\n\nI\'m now integrating `useEmergencyQuickTriggers` more completely. I\'m focusing on refining `handleDispatchQuickTriggerSos` to incorporate location sharing alongside SOS alerts and dual calls, making sure to respect the user\'s preference for automatic location sharing. I\'m also ensuring the correct logic is in place for handling voice-based activation via wake word or URL parameters. I\'ve updated the `suspended` and `onWakeWordDetected` props accordingly.\n\n\n**Implementing Voice Integration**\n\nI\'m now integrating the voice banner to dynamically display the secret code and wake word. I\'m also adding necessary props to `HomeAboutPage` for preferences and voice status, and implementing an orb button for universal voice control across the app. This will allow for easy toggle of full-app voice control from any page.\n\n\n**Integrating Wake Word Logic**\n\nI\'m now focusing on integrating wake word detection within `/src/App.tsx`. I\'m tracking the `autoStartVoice` state, initializing it from the `?mode=voicewake` URL parameter. I\'m working to pass the `onWakeWordDetected` handler into `preLoginTriggers`, which will address edge cases surrounding initial login. The `fallbackUser` handling, and direct use of `handleLoginSuccess`, should streamline the user\'s entry into `HomeDashboard` with hands-free voice control enabled. I\'m carefully considering how to pass `autoStartVoice` and `onConsumeAutoStartVoice` to the `HomeDashboard` component.\n\n\n**Refining UI Elements**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on UI refinements across the application. I\'m focusing on `/src/components/LoginScreen.tsx` and `/src/components/SignupScreen.tsx` to standardize the background color using `oursafe-canvas-bg` and add wake word cues to the login banner. I\'m expanding `HomeAboutPage.tsx` to display an \"Always-On Automation Active\" strip with status indicators and quick-access buttons, and refining the community feedback section. Finally, I\'m updating `server.ts` to include \"OurSafe\" wake word in system instructions and add `open_settings` to `SAFETY_VOICE_TOOLS`.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "Iz0Ea7vWFOitz7IPhca30A8"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_6671273236612542291"
      name: "multi_replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"Description\":\"Wire OurSafe wake-word voice launch, automatic live GPS sharing on SOS triggers, floating voice orb, open_settings tool, and layered botanical background in HomeDashboard\", \"Instruction\":\"Update HomeDashboard props, voice executor, wake-word handler, quick triggers suspension, auto live GPS sharing on trigger, root background, banner copy, HomeAboutPage props, and floating voice button.\", \"ReplacementChunks\":[{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":94, \"ReplacementContent\":\"interface HomeDashboardProps {\\n  user: UserProfile;\\n  onUpdateUser: (updated: UserProfile) => void;\\n  onLogout: () => void;\\n  autoStartVoice?: boolean;\\n  onConsumeAutoStartVoice?: () => void;\\n}\\n\\nexport const HomeDashboard: React.FC<HomeDashboardProps> = ({\\n  user,\\n  onUpdateUser,\\n  onLogout,\\n  autoStartVoice = false,\\n  onConsumeAutoStartVoice,\\n}) => {\\n  const [activePage, setActivePage] = useState<AppPage>(() => {\\n    if (typeof window === \'undefined\') return \'home\';\\n    const mode = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search).get(\'mode\');\\n    if (mode === \'sos\') return \'sos\';\\n    if (mode === \'voicewake\') return \'assistant\';\\n    return \'home\';\\n  });\", \"StartLine\":78, \"TargetContent\":\"interface HomeDashboardProps {\\n  user: UserProfile;\\n  onUpdateUser: (updated: UserProfile) => void;\\n  onLogout: () => void;\\n}\\n\\nexport const HomeDashboard: React.FC<HomeDashboardProps> = ({\\n  user,\\n  onUpdateUser,\\n  onLogout,\\n}) => {\\n  const [activePage, setActivePage] = useState<AppPage>(() => {\\n    if (typeof window === \'undefined\') return \'home\';\\n    const mode = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search).get(\'mode\');\\n    return mode === \'sos\' ? \'sos\' : \'home\';\\n  });\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":1258, \"ReplacementContent\":\"        case \'open_settings\': {\\n          setActiveModal(\'settings\');\\n          return {\\n            ok: true,\\n            summary:\\n              \'Opened Settings where you can turn 3x Shake, Secret Voice Code, Screen Tap SOS, and \\\"OurSafe\\\" Wake Word ON or OFF.\',\\n          };\\n        }\\n\\n        default:\\n          return {\\n            ok: false,\\n            summary: `Unsupported command \\\"${call.name}\\\".`,\\n          };\", \"StartLine\":1252, \"TargetContent\":\"        default:\\n          return {\\n            ok: false,\\n            summary: `Unsupported command \\\"${call.name}\\\".`,\\n          };\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":1460, \"ReplacementContent\":\"  // Persistent Full-App AI Voice Controller (stays connected across ALL pages!)\\n  const voiceController = useGlobalVoiceController({\\n    userName: firstName,\\n    primaryGuardianName: primaryGuardian?.name,\\n    primaryGuardianPhone: primaryGuardian?.phone,\\n    threatActive: Boolean(threatSession?.active),\\n    sosActive: Boolean(latestSosAlert),\\n    isOnline,\\n    onExecuteVoiceCommand: handleExecuteVoiceCommand,\\n  });\\n\\n  // \\\"Hey Google\\\"-style Hands-Free Wake Word (\\\"OurSafe\\\") -> Wakes App & Starts Full Voice Control\\n  const handleWakeWordDetected = useCallback(\\n    ({\\n      spokenText,\\n      followUpCommand,\\n    }: {\\n      spokenText: string;\\n      followUpCommand: string;\\n    }) => {\\n      setLockScreenShieldOpen(false);\\n      setActiveModal(null);\\n\\n      if (followUpCommand && followUpCommand.trim().length > 0) {\\n        showToast(`\\\"OurSafe\\\" heard: \\\"${followUpCommand}\\\" \342\200\224 executing now...`);\\n        void voiceController.runTextCommand(followUpCommand);\\n      } else {\\n        showToast(\\n          `\\\"${user.preferences.wakeWordPhrase || \'OurSafe\'}\\\" activated \342\200\224 Full-App Voice Control is listening.`\\n        );\\n      }\\n\\n      if (\\n        isOnline &&\\n        voiceController.liveStatus !== \'connected\' &&\\n        voiceController.liveStatus !== \'connecting\'\\n      ) {\\n        void voiceController.startLiveVoice();\\n      } else if (!isOnline) {\\n        setActivePage(\'assistant\');\\n        showToast(\\n          `Woke via \\\"${spokenText}\\\". Offline mode active \342\200\224 tap SOS or use direct calling.`\\n        );\\n      }\\n    },\\n    [\\n      isOnline,\\n      showToast,\\n      user.preferences.wakeWordPhrase,\\n      voiceController,\\n    ]\\n  );\\n\\n  // Auto-launch full voice control when woken from Login/Lock Shield or ?mode=voicewake\\n  const autoVoiceTriggeredRef = useRef(false);\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    const queryWake =\\n      typeof window !== \'undefined\' &&\\n      new URLSearchParams(window.location.search).get(\'mode\') === \'voicewake\';\\n    if ((autoStartVoice || queryWake) && !autoVoiceTriggeredRef.current) {\\n      autoVoiceTriggeredRef.current = true;\\n      onConsumeAutoStartVoice?.();\\n      if (\\n        isOnline &&\\n        voiceController.liveStatus !== \'connected\' &&\\n        voiceController.liveStatus !== \'connecting\'\\n      ) {\\n        showToast(\\n          `\\\"${user.preferences.wakeWordPhrase || \'OurSafe\'}\\\" woke the app \342\200\224 Full-App Voice Control ON.`\\n        );\\n        void voiceController.startLiveVoice();\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }, [\\n    autoStartVoice,\\n    isOnline,\\n    onConsumeAutoStartVoice,\\n    showToast,\\n    user.preferences.wakeWordPhrase,\\n    voiceController,\\n  ]);\\n\\n  // Global Hands-Free & Outside-App Emergency Triggers (3x Shake, Secret Voice Code, Screen Tap, \\\"OurSafe\\\" Wake Word)\\n  const quickTriggers = useEmergencyQuickTriggers({\\n    preferences: user.preferences,\\n    isLockScreenActive: lockScreenShieldOpen,\\n    // Pause background wake-word mic while Gemini Live Voice holds the microphone; auto-resumes when Live closes\\n    suspended:\\n      Boolean(activeQuickTriggerEvent) ||\\n      voiceController.liveStatus === \'connected\' ||\\n      voiceController.liveStatus === \'connecting\',\\n    onTriggerSos: (event) => {\\n      requestGeoLocation();\\n      setActiveQuickTriggerEvent(event);\\n    },\\n    onWakeWordDetected: handleWakeWordDetected,\\n  });\\n\\n  const handleDispatchQuickTriggerSos = useCallback(\\n    (event: QuickTriggerEvent) => {\\n      triggerSosAlert(event.label, event.detail);\\n      openDualCall(event.label);\\n      if (user.preferences.autoShareLocationOnTrigger !== false) {\\n        handleToggleLiveLocationShare(true, 30);\\n      }\\n    },\\n    [\\n      triggerSosAlert,\\n      openDualCall,\\n      user.preferences.autoShareLocationOnTrigger,\\n      handleToggleLiveLocationShare,\\n    ]\\n  );\", \"StartLine\":1431, \"TargetContent\":\"  // Persistent Full-App AI Voice Controller (stays connected across ALL pages!)\\n  const voiceController = useGlobalVoiceController({\\n    userName: firstName,\\n    primaryGuardianName: primaryGuardian?.name,\\n    primaryGuardianPhone: primaryGuardian?.phone,\\n    threatActive: Boolean(threatSession?.active),\\n    sosActive: Boolean(latestSosAlert),\\n    isOnline,\\n    onExecuteVoiceCommand: handleExecuteVoiceCommand,\\n  });\\n\\n  // Global Hands-Free & Outside-App Emergency Triggers (3x Shake, Secret Voice Code, Double/Triple Screen Tap)\\n  const quickTriggers = useEmergencyQuickTriggers({\\n    preferences: user.preferences,\\n    isLockScreenActive: lockScreenShieldOpen,\\n    suspended: Boolean(activeQuickTriggerEvent),\\n    onTriggerSos: (event) => {\\n      requestGeoLocation();\\n      setActiveQuickTriggerEvent(event);\\n    },\\n  });\\n\\n  const handleDispatchQuickTriggerSos = useCallback(\\n    (event: QuickTriggerEvent) => {\\n      triggerSosAlert(event.label, event.detail);\\n      openDualCall(event.label);\\n    },\\n    [triggerSosAlert, openDualCall]\\n  );\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":1541, \"ReplacementContent\":\"  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"min-h-screen oursafe-canvas-bg flex flex-col pb-20 lg:pb-10\\\">\", \"StartLine\":1538, \"TargetContent\":\"  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"min-h-screen bg-[#CDD7C1] flex flex-col pb-20 lg:pb-10\\\">\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":1745, \"ReplacementContent\":\"              {quickTriggers.voiceListening && (\\n                <span className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-emerald-300\\\">\\n                  <Radio className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 animate-pulse\\\" />\\n                  <span>\\n                    Listening:\\n                    {user.preferences.voiceActivationEnabled\\n                      ? ` \\\"${user.preferences.voiceKeyword}\\\" (SOS)`\\n                      : \'\'}\\n                    {user.preferences.voiceActivationEnabled &&\\n                    user.preferences.wakeWordEnabled !== false\\n                      ? \' \302\267 \'\\n                      : \'\'}\\n                    {user.preferences.wakeWordEnabled !== false\\n                      ? ` \\\"${user.preferences.wakeWordPhrase || \'OurSafe\'}\\\" (Voice App)`\\n                      : \'\'}\\n                  </span>\\n                </span>\\n              )}\", \"StartLine\":1735, \"TargetContent\":\"              {quickTriggers.voiceListening && (\\n                <span className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-emerald-300\\\">\\n                  <Radio className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 animate-pulse\\\" />\\n                  <span>\\n                    Listening for Secret Code &ldquo;{user.preferences.voiceKeyword}&rdquo;\\n                  </span>\\n                </span>\\n              )}\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":1825, \"ReplacementContent\":\"        {activePage === \'home\' && (\\n          <HomeAboutPage\\n            userName={user.fullName}\\n            preferences={user.preferences}\\n            voiceListening={quickTriggers.voiceListening}\\n            liveVoiceActive={\\n              voiceController.liveStatus === \'connected\' ||\\n              voiceController.liveStatus === \'connecting\'\\n            }\\n            onNavigatePage={(p) => setActivePage(p)}\\n            onOpenContacts={() => setActiveModal(\'contacts\')}\\n            onOpenSettings={() => setActiveModal(\'settings\')}\\n            onOpenLockShield={() => openLockAndHomeShield(\'lock_screen\')}\\n            onWakeVoice={() =>\\n              handleWakeWordDetected({\\n                spokenText: user.preferences.wakeWordPhrase || \'OurSafe\',\\n                followUpCommand: \'\',\\n              })\\n            }\\n          />\\n        )}\", \"StartLine\":1818, \"TargetContent\":\"        {activePage === \'home\' && (\\n          <HomeAboutPage\\n            userName={user.fullName}\\n            onNavigatePage={(p) => setActivePage(p)}\\n            onOpenContacts={() => setActiveModal(\'contacts\')}\\n          />\\n        )}\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":2031, \"ReplacementContent\":\"      {/* Floating Hands-Free \\\"OurSafe\\\" Full-App Voice Assistant Orb (Available on Every Page) */}\\n      <button\\n        type=\\\"button\\\"\\n        data-ignore-sos-tap=\\\"true\\\"\\n        onClick={() => {\\n          if (\\n            voiceController.liveStatus === \'connected\' ||\\n            voiceController.liveStatus === \'connecting\'\\n          ) {\\n            voiceController.disconnectLiveVoice();\\n          } else {\\n            handleWakeWordDetected({\\n              spokenText: user.preferences.wakeWordPhrase || \'OurSafe\',\\n              followUpCommand: \'\',\\n            });\\n          }\\n        }}\\n        aria-label={\\n          voiceController.liveStatus === \'connected\'\\n            ? \'Stop OurSafe Full-App Voice Control\'\\n            : \'Start OurSafe Full-App Voice Control\'\\n        }\\n        title={\\n          voiceController.liveStatus === \'connected\'\\n            ? \'OurSafe Voice ON \342\200\224 Tap to stop\'\\n            : `Say \\\"${user.preferences.wakeWordPhrase || \'OurSafe\'}\\\" or tap for hands-free voice control`\\n        }\\n        className={`fixed right-4 bottom-[74px] lg:bottom-6 z-40 h-12 px-4 rounded-full shadow-lg flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold text-xs transition-all cursor-pointer select-none border ${\\n          voiceController.liveStatus === \'connected\' ||\\n          voiceController.liveStatus === \'connecting\'\\n            ? \'bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white border-emerald-300/60 ring-4 ring-emerald-400/25\'\\n            : \'bg-[#182215] hover:bg-[#2F4526] text-[#F6F9F2] border-[#B8C6A8]/40\'\\n        }`}\\n      >\\n        <Mic\\n          className={`w-4 h-4 shrink-0 ${\\n            voiceController.liveStatus === \'connected\' ? \'animate-pulse\' : \'\'\\n          }`}\\n        />\\n        <span className=\\\"whitespace-nowrap\\\">\\n          {voiceController.liveStatus === \'connecting\'\\n            ? \'Connecting...\'\\n            : voiceController.liveStatus === \'connected\'\\n              ? \'Voice ON\'\\n              : `Say \\\"${user.preferences.wakeWordPhrase || \'OurSafe\'}\\\"`}\\n        </span>\\n      </button>\\n\\n      {/* MODALS */}\", \"StartLine\":2029, \"TargetContent\":\"      {/* MODALS */}\"}], \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/HomeDashboard.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Updating HomeDashboard automation & voice orb\", \"toolSummary\":\"Update HomeDashboard automation & voice\"}"
