  planner_response {
    response: "Hands-free automation, minimal lock-screen icon overlay, **\"OurSafe\"** voice wake control, and the layered background are now complete and live:\n\n- **Minimal Lock-Screen Icon Overlay (Unobstructed Phone Screen)**: On the Phone Lock Screen and Home Screen, OurSafe no longer covers the screen\342\200\224it displays only a compact bottom-right floating **SOS** icon or compact **SOS \302\267 OurSafe** badge (customizable in **Settings** and mirrored in the Android native overlay service).\n- **All 3 Safety Systems Always-On (with Settings ON/OFF Controls)**:\n  - **3\303\227 Phone Shake**, **Secret Voice Code (\"Red Rose\")**, and **Triple/Double Screen Tap** stay armed automatically\342\200\224even without opening or signing into the app\342\200\224and automatically **place the emergency call and turn on live GPS location sharing** to both Guardians and Police.\n  - Manage each system individually or toggle **All ON / All OFF** anytime in **Settings**.\n- **\"OurSafe\" Wake Word & Whole-App Voice Control**:\n  - Say **\"OurSafe\"** (like *\"Hey Google\"*) from the Lock Screen, Login screen, or anywhere inside the app to wake OurSafe automatically into full voice control\342\200\224with instant follow-up commands such as *\"OurSafe open SOS\"*, *\"OurSafe activate threat mode\"*, *\"OurSafe share my location\"*, *\"OurSafe open travel mode\"*, *\"OurSafe find police\"*, or *\"OurSafe open settings\"*.\n  - A persistent floating **\"Say \'OurSafe\'\"** voice orb stays accessible across every page, and the background wake microphone automatically yields to Live Voice and resumes when Live Voice stops.\n- **Refined Visual Canvas & Readiness Overview**:\n  - Replaced the flat canvas with a layered, viewport-anchored botanical background across Login, Sign Up, and Dashboard, plus a realistic twilight lock-screen backdrop.\n  - Added an **Always-On Hands-Free Safety Systems** status strip directly on the Home screen with one-tap access to **Lock Icon** and **On / Off in Settings**."
