      arguments_json: "{\"Description\":\"Add open_contacts voice tool and update system prompt for OurSafe/House Safe spoken greeting flow\", \"Instruction\":\"Add open_contacts tool to SAFETY_VOICE_TOOLS and mention the OurSafe app is here greeting in buildSystemInstruction.\", \"ReplacementChunks\":[{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":266, \"ReplacementContent\":\"  {\\n    name: \'open_settings\',\\n    description:\\n      \'Opens OurSafe Settings where the user can turn 3x Phone Shake SOS, Secret Voice Code (\\\"Red Rose\\\"), Screen Tap SOS, \\\"OurSafe\\\" Wake Word, and Lock-Screen Icon Display ON or OFF.\',\\n    parameters: {\\n      type: Type.OBJECT,\\n      properties: {},\\n    },\\n  },\\n  {\\n    name: \'open_contacts\',\\n    description:\\n      \'Opens the Trusted Guardian Emergency Contacts modal so the user can view, add, or update guardian phone numbers.\',\\n    parameters: {\\n      type: Type.OBJECT,\\n      properties: {},\\n    },\\n  },\\n];\", \"StartLine\":254, \"TargetContent\":\"  {\\n    name: \'open_settings\',\\n    description:\\n      \'Opens OurSafe Settings where the user can turn 3x Phone Shake SOS, Secret Voice Code (\\\"Red Rose\\\"), Screen Tap SOS, \\\"OurSafe\\\" Wake Word, and Lock-Screen Icon Display ON or OFF.\',\\n    parameters: {\\n      type: Type.OBJECT,\\n      properties: {},\\n    },\\n  },\\n];\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":292, \"ReplacementContent\":\"CRITICAL ROLE \342\200\224 FULL HANDS-FREE VOICE APP AUTOMATION (\\\"OurSafe\\\" / \\\"House Safe\\\" WAKE WORD):\\n- The user can wake OurSafe hands-free like \\\"Hey Google\\\" anytime by saying \\\"OurSafe\\\" (or phonetically \\\"House Safe\\\"). When awakened, the app greets them aloud with \\\"OurSafe app is here, how can I help you?\\\" and listens for ANY command across the whole application.\\n- Whenever the user says commands like \\\"Go to SOS\\\", \\\"Open SOS\\\", \\\"Call both guardian and police\\\", \\\"Call police\\\", \\\"Call my guardian\\\", \\\"Activate Threat Mode\\\", \\\"Dread mode\\\", \\\"Deactivate Threat Mode\\\", \\\"Send emergency alert\\\", \\\"Share my location\\\", \\\"Share my business\\\", \\\"Find police numbers\\\", \\\"Open nearby police\\\", \\\"Open travel mode\\\", \\\"Verify auto number\\\", \\\"Open lock shield\\\", \\\"Open settings\\\", \\\"Open guardians / contacts\\\", \\\"Turn on or off shake / triggers\\\", \\\"Start a fake call\\\", \\\"Set a check-in\\\", \\\"Open history\\\", or \\\"Go home\\\", you MUST immediately execute the matching tool function first, then briefly confirm in 1 to 2 calm sentences.\\n- For \\\"Go to SOS\\\" or \\\"Open SOS\\\": call open_sos with initiateAlert: true and callBothGuardianAndPolice: true immediately.\\n- For \\\"Activate Threat Mode\\\" or \\\"Dread Mode\\\": call activate_threat_mode with autoStartRecording: \\\"video\\\" immediately (continuous video+audio recording starts automatically without extra confirmations).\\n- For \\\"Share my location\\\" or \\\"Share my business\\\": call share_live_location with includePolice: true so live GPS is shared with BOTH registered guardians AND nearest police.\\n- For \\\"Open settings\\\" or changing Shake / Red Rose / Triple Tap / Lock-Screen Icon ON/OFF: call open_settings immediately.\\n- For \\\"Open guardians\\\" or \\\"Open contacts\\\": call open_contacts immediately.\\n- Never invent fake phone numbers or street addresses. Keep spoken replies concise, calm, and reassuring.`;\", \"StartLine\":277, \"TargetContent\":\"CRITICAL ROLE \342\200\224 FULL HANDS-FREE VOICE APP AUTOMATION (\\\"OurSafe\\\" WAKE WORD):\\n- The user can wake OurSafe hands-free like \\\"Hey Google\\\" by saying \\\"OurSafe\\\", and once Voice Control is ON, they control the ENTIRE OurSafe application purely by voice without manual taps.\\n- Whenever the user says commands like \\\"Go to SOS\\\", \\\"Open SOS\\\", \\\"Call both guardian and police\\\", \\\"Call police\\\", \\\"Call my guardian\\\", \\\"Activate Threat Mode\\\", \\\"Dread mode\\\", \\\"Deactivate Threat Mode\\\", \\\"Send emergency alert\\\", \\\"Share my location\\\", \\\"Share my business\\\", \\\"Find police numbers\\\", \\\"Open nearby police\\\", \\\"Open travel mode\\\", \\\"Verify auto number\\\", \\\"Open lock shield\\\", \\\"Open settings\\\", \\\"Turn on or off shake / triggers\\\", \\\"Start a fake call\\\", \\\"Set a check-in\\\", or \\\"Open history\\\", you MUST immediately execute the matching tool function first, then briefly confirm in 1 to 2 calm sentences.\\n- For \\\"Go to SOS\\\" or \\\"Open SOS\\\": call open_sos with initiateAlert: true and callBothGuardianAndPolice: true immediately.\\n- For \\\"Activate Threat Mode\\\" or \\\"Dread Mode\\\": call activate_threat_mode with autoStartRecording: \\\"video\\\" immediately (continuous video+audio recording starts automatically without extra confirmations).\\n- For \\\"Share my location\\\" or \\\"Share my business\\\": call share_live_location with includePolice: true so live GPS is shared with BOTH registered guardians AND nearest police.\\n- For \\\"Open settings\\\" or changing Shake / Red Rose / Triple Tap / Lock-Screen Icon ON/OFF: call open_settings immediately.\\n- Never invent fake phone numbers or street addresses. Keep spoken replies concise, calm, and reassuring.`;\"}], \"TargetFile\":\"/server.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Updating server.ts voice tools and greeting prompt\", \"toolSummary\":\"Update server.ts voice prompt\"}"
