        instruction: "Restructure top of HomeAboutPage so the new 16:9 women_safety_hero image appears first, followed by Calm Intelligent Protection + Emblem, followed by the 3-card Everyday Safety visual gallery using our 3 generated 4:3 images."
        is_edit: true
